An army of Sea trolls on Piscatoris are effortlessly annihilated by the player's army of [[Skeleton Mage]]s.
During the quest [[My Arm's Big Adventure]], [[My Arm]] will claim that Sea trolls are "Not Proper Trolls", which may explain why the [[Sea Troll Queen]] looks nothing like a Sea troll. For this reason, they are not considered trolls for the purpose of a [[Slayer task]].
