'''Seaweed''' can be found along the [[Mushroom Forest]] beach, located on [[Fossil Island]]. The seaweed are one of the clues found part way into [[tracking]] a [[Herbiboar]], and can be inspected to find footprints leading to another clue ({{mes|Something has disturbed this seaweed recently, it smells.}}). Occasionally when inspecting the seaweed players may be awarded 50 [[Hunter]] experience, as well as a chance at finding either some [[numulite]] or an [[unidentified fossil]].

