{{external|rs}} {{otheruses|normal farming tool|the magical farming tool rewarded from the quest [[Fairytale I - Growing Pains]]|Magic secateurs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Secateurs |image = [[File:Secateurs.png]] |release = [[6 June]] [[2005]] |update = Seeds, Bankspace And Advisors |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = Good for pruning away diseased leaves. |value = 5 |weight = 0.453 |exchange = Yes |id = 5329 }} [[File:Secateurs detail.png|left|100px]] '''Secateurs''' are used to prune diseased [[Leaves (disambiguation)|leaves]] from [[Trees#Farming trees|trees]] or [[bushes]] grown using the [[Farming]] skill. They can be bought at most [[farming shops]], and can be acquired freely from a [[Tool store 5|Tool Store 5]]. They can also be stored at the [[tool leprechaun]]s.
Apart from being used to cure plants from disease, they can be used to obtain [[willow branches]] from farmed willow trees. Up to 6 willow branches can be cut at a time, after which the branches regrow one at a time at regular intervals of approximately 10 minutes. ==Item sources== {{Drop sources|Secateurs}} ===Shop locations=== {{Store locations list|Secateurs}}
==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 7 July 2021 |update = Small Changes & Tweaks |poll = |change = The secateurs' position on female players has been adjusted so that they appear to be held properly when farming. }} {{Subject changes |date = 11 July 2005 |update = Farming |change = *The "Wield" option was removed. *The item's examine was changed from "''Farming skill coming in July!''" to "''Good for pruning away diseased leaves.''" }} {{Subject changes footer}}
{{Farming tools}} [[Category:Tools]] [[Category:Items exempt from Grand Exchange tax]]

{{Infobox Item |name = Secateurs attachment |image = [[File:Secateurs attachment.png]] |release = [[28 June]] [[2023]] |update = Forestry: The Way of the Forester - Part One |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = Collects leaves when chopping trees. |value = 100 |weight = 0.000 |exchange = Yes |id = 28161 }} [[File:Secateurs attachment detail.png|left|130px]] '''Secateurs attachments''' are a stackable item used in [[Woodcutting]]. While in the inventory or stored in a [[forestry kit]], when players receive a [[leaf]] from cutting trees (a 1/4 chance for every log cut, regardless of Woodcutting level), a Secateurs attachment is consumed and an additional second leaf is obtained.
They can be created by using a [[secateurs blade]], purchased from the [[Forestry Shop]], on an [[iron bar]]. This requires level 35 [[Woodcutting]] and [[Smithing]], granting 32 [[Crafting]] experience; each set will produce 50 attachments.
They will not be consumed when failing to roll for a leaf, nor are they consumed from chopping trees that do not have a corresponding leaf, such as [[camphor tree|camphor]], [[Ironwood tree|ironwood]], or [[rosewood tree]]s. ==Creation== {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 35 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 0 |skill2 = Woodcutting |skill2lvl = 35 |skill2boostable = Yes |skill2exp = 0 |skill3 = Crafting |skill3lvl = 0 |skill3boostable = |skill3exp = 32 |ticks = 3 |members = Yes |mat1 = Secateurs blade |mat2 = Iron bar |output1 = Secateurs attachment |output1quantity = 50 }}
{{Forestry}}

{{Infobox Item |name = Secateurs blade |image = [[File:Secateurs blade.png]] |release = [[28 June]] [[2023]] |update = Forestry: The Way of the Forester - Part One |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Craft, Drop |examine = An ingredient for the secateurs attachment. |value = 1000 |weight = 0.000 |exchange = Yes |id = 28159 |leagueRegion = Misthalin,Kandarin,Tirannwn,Varlamore }} [[File:Secateurs blade detail.png|left|130px]] The '''secateurs blade''' is an item purchased from the [[Forestry Shop]] for 20 [[anima-infused bark]], as well as 10 noted [[oak logs]] and 5 noted [[willow logs]]. These logs can be bought on the [[Grand Exchange]] for {{Coins|(10 * ( {{GEP|Oak logs}}) + (5 * {{GEP|Willow logs}}) )}}.
With level 35 [[Woodcutting]] and [[Smithing]], players can create [[secateurs attachment]]s by combining the blade and an [[iron bar]]; each set will produce 50 attachments.
