[[File:Security book detail.png|left|130px]]
The '''Security book''', titled '''Account Security''', is a [[book]] that contains information on how you can protect your [[account]] and [[bank|bank account]] through:
*using a [[Jagex Account]], which has built-in two-factor authentication;
*setting up two-factor authentication on your email address;
*your [[password]]:
:- how it is built up (use both letters and numbers);
:- how memorable it is to you;
:- how hard it is for others to guess;
:- the way you look after it (don't write it down nor save it in a text file, as others may find it; don't share it with ANYONE);
*setting a [[Bank PIN]];
*not leaving your account logged in while you are away from the device;
*overcoming the challenges of the [[Stronghold of Security]].

The Security book can be obtained for free from the [[Security Guard]] in [[Port Sarim jail]]. It can also be found in a [[Bookcase space|bookcase]] in a [[player-owned house]]. The book can be purchased from several [[general store]]s and from [[Trader Stan's Trading Post]].

