==Trivia==
* In ''[[rsw:RuneScape|RuneScape 3]],'' Seren originates from the world of [[Freneskae]], where her [[Mother of Seren|mother]], who is one of the Elder Gods, resides. Seren's brother is stated to be [[Zaros]], the god of darkness and counterpart to Seren, the goddess of light. Mah's later creations include the [[Mahjarrat]] and [[Phantom Muspah|Muspahs]].

