{{Redirect|Money bag|the [[Crack the Clue III]] reward|Infinite money bag}} {{Infobox Construction |name = Servant's money bag |image = [[File:Servant's money bag built.png|230px]] |icon = [[File:Servant's money bag icon.png]] |furniturename = Servant's money bag |release = [[23 February]] [[2017]] |update = Shift-Click Drop & QoL |level = 58 |experience = 595 |room = [[Bedroom]] |hotspot = [[Corner space]] |flatpack = No |examine = Leave money here so the servant needn't bother asking you for it. |id = 28859 |itemid = 21213 }} The '''servant's money bag''' can be built in the [[corner space]] of the [[bedroom]] in a [[player-owned house]]. It requires 58 [[Construction]] to build and gives 595 [[experience]] when built. The player must have a [[hammer]] and a [[saw]] in their inventory to build it.
The money bag can store up to {{NoCoins|3000000|c}} in increments of 100 coins, and will automatically pay the [[servant]]'s fee every eight trips, making it useful when training Construction to save an additional inventory slot and time paying the servant. The money can be withdrawn at any time.
Multiple money bags can be built, but all of them link to the same money pool.
