[[File:Seth Groats chathead.png|left]]
'''Seth Groats''' is a farmer, who resides in the house next to his [[chicken]] farm between [[Lumbridge]] and [[Varrock]]. Seth is the father of [[Gillie Groats]], a young milkmaid in Lumbridge.

You must run a favour for this man in the [[quest]] [[One Small Favour]] in order to get him to give you a month's supply of chickens for the [[H.A.M.]] leader [[Johanhus Ulsbrecht]]. He will ask you to bring three [[steel bar]]s to [[Horvik]] in Varrock, and will also request five [[chicken cage]]s to transport the chickens.

During the [[The Ides of Milk]] quest, you are required to talk to Seth Groats, where he mentions you should read his book, [[The Groats Principles]], which you can find on the shelf to the south.

