{{otheruses|the severed leg found in [[Darkmeyer]]|the severed leg obtained during [[The General's Shadow]]|Severed leg (The General's Shadow)}} {{Infobox Item |name = Severed leg |image = [[File:Severed leg.png]] |release = [[4 June]] [[2020]] |update = Darkmeyer |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wield, Drop |examine = A severed human leg. |value = 1 |weight = 1.800 |id = 24792 }} [[File:Severed leg detail.png|left|130px]] A '''severed leg''' is a [[fun weapon]] that can be obtained from a [[corpse cart]], which are found around [[Darkmeyer]], accessed after the completion of the [[Sins of the Father]] [[quest]].
Equipping the severed leg allows players to "Whack" other players like the [[rubber chicken]] does, but cannot be fumbled like it, and thus is never forcefully dropped on the ground.
