{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Spell |name = Shadow Burst |image = [[File:Shadow Burst.png]] |release = [[18 April]] [[2005]] |update = Desert Treasure |members = Yes |level = 64 |spellbook = Ancient |type = Combat |exp = 37 |element = Shadow |damage = 18 |cost = {{RuneReq|Soul=2|Chaos=4|Air=1|Death=2}} |speed = 5 ticks |anim = [[File:Shadow Burst.gif|300px]] |sound = [[File:Shadow Burst.ogg]] }} [[File:Shadow Burst icon (mobile).png|left]] '''Shadow Burst''' is the second tier [[Shadow spell]] from the [[Ancient Magicks]] spellbook, available at level 64 [[Magic]]. It is capable of hitting up to 18 damage (without any [[magic damage]] boosts) per cast.
Shadow Burst has the ability to lower your target's [[Attack]] level by 10%, this effect '''does not''' stack to lower the target's Attack level to zero. It is also able to target up to nine targets in a 3x3 grid around its primary target, just like all other [[Burst spells|burst]] and [[barrage spells]].
As with all [[Ancient Magicks]] spells, the [[Desert Treasure I]] quest is required to cast this spell.
When used against the [[Abyssal Sire]], Shadow Burst has a 50% chance of disorienting it for the first phase of the fight. ==Damage== ===Calculator=== {{Magic damage calculator|Shadow Burst|weapons=Thammaron's sceptre (Wilderness),Accursed sceptre (Wilderness),Dragon hunter wand}}
