{{Quick Guide}}

==Details==
{{Quest details page|Shadow of the Storm}}

'''Tip:''' To save some time, you can buy a [[black wizard hat]] from [[Betty's Magic Emporium]] in [[Port Sarim]] and [[Priest robes]] from [[Varrock]], or dye [[desert robes]] with [[black dye]] (requires [[pestle and mortar]] and [[vial]] to make), a [[black cape]] can be used for the third item. Note that dyed desert robes no longer protect you from [[desert heat]]. Void gear does not count.

==Walkthrough==
===Starting out===
{{Checklist|
*Talk to [[Father Reen]] outside [[Al Kharid]] bank. {{Chat option|1That's me!}}
*Travel to the [[Ruins of Uzer]] via the [[magic carpet]] south of Al Kharid (or use the [[necklace of passage]] teleport to [[Eagle's Eyrie]] and run south-east). You can also use a fairy ring ({{Fairycode|DLQ}}) and go north-east.
*Talk to [[Father Badden]] near the ruin entrance. {{Chat option|1Reen sent me.|3So what do you want me to do?|1How can I do that?}} '''Be sure to have Silverlight''' in your inventory.
*Pick and use a black mushroom (or black dye) on Silverlight to dye it black (you can find some beside the staircase).
*Go down the stairs and grab a copy of the [[Strange implement]] in the north-west corner of the ruin.
*Talk to [[Evil Dave]] in the dungeon wearing your 3 black items and your dyed Silverlight. {{Chat option|2I want to join your group.|1I'm evil!}}
}}

===Ritual===
{{Checklist|
*Talk to [[Denath]] on the other side of the portal. {{Chat option|4What do I have to do?}}
*Talk to [[Jennifer]] to get a [[demonic sigil mould]]. {{Chat option|2Do you have the demonic sigil mould?}}
*Talk to [[Matthew]]. {{Chat option|3Do you know what happened to Josef?}}
*Go to any [[furnace]] and smelt a [[demonic sigil]] (use [[silver bar]] on furnace and select 'demonic sigil').
*Your black outfit can now be discarded and replaced with combat gear (keep Silverlight with you).
*Head back to Uzer and talk to the clay golem outside about last night. {{Chat option|3Did you see anything happen last night?}}
*Search the nearby kilns for a book (there are four kilns – the last two are on the east side of the ruin, and by the magic carpet).
*Read the book, and take it to Matthew on the other side of the portal
*Go north and talk to Denath. {{Chat option|4I forgot the incantation.}} (or {{Chat option|2I forgot the incantation.}} during the ritual). '''Write down''' the incantation he tells you as it is used '''twice''' during the quest.
*Complete the circle and click the sigil in your inventory to chant the incantation (unequip the Silverlight if nothing happens).
*TAKE THE DEMONIC SIGIL DENATH DROPPED ON THE FLOOR. (If you do not, you will have to create another Demonic sigil)
*Enter the portal to exit the room and take Tanya's sigil.
*Tell Evil Dave to return to the lair {{Chat option|2You've got to get back to the throne room!}} – you should have 4 sigils now.}}

===Rallying the troops===
{{Checklist|
*Talk to Father Badden outside.
*Convince Father Reen to join the ritual. {{Chat option|3Oh, don't be so simple-minded!}}
*Talk to the golem, he will refuse to help. {{Chat option|3I could just reprogram you again.}}
*Use the Strange implement on the golem to reprogram him.
*Talk to the golem again to make him enter the dungeon.
}}

===The final fight===
{{Instance}}
'''NOTE:''' this boss can be flinched by standing behind the north-western torch.

UIM concerns: If you die during the fight, all your items will appear on the ground outside the portal in the temple. {{Checklist|
*Talk to Matthew to start the incantation, say it '''backwards'''. {{Chat option|1Yes}}
*Kill [[Agrith Naar]] with any weapon, but the final blow must be with Silverlight. The demon will heal if you run away as the final blow is being dealt.
*Unequip Silverlight.
*Choose your reward to finish the quest.
*'''Congratulations, quest complete!'''
}}

