'''Shadow warriors''' are one of few monsters that are hidden on the player's [[minimap]]. They are not considered [[undead]], so the [[salve amulet]] has no effect on them. Shadow warriors appear to be wielding [[battleaxe]]s, but they attack at the same speed as [[scimitar]]s. After completion of [[Legends' Quest]], Shadow warriors are a possible [[Slayer task]] from [[Chaeldar]] and [[Vannaka]].

