{{Infobox Combat Achievement |name = Shadows Move... |image = [[File:Nex - shadow smash.png|300px]] |release = [[23 February]] [[2022]] |update = Nex Achievements and Loot Keys |members = Yes |description = Kill Nex without anyone being hit by the Shadow Smash attack. |tier = Master |monster = Nex |type = Mechanical |id = 420 |leagueRegion = Asgarnia }} '''Shadows Move...''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires players to kill [[Nex]] without anyone being hit by her Shadow Smash attack.
