{{Quick Guide}}
==Details== {{Quest details page|Shadows of Custodia}}
==Walkthrough==
{{Checklist| *Read the Noticeboard in the [[Auburn Pub]] {{Chat option|1Yes.}} *Talk to [[Marcus]] in the bar *Talk to the Bartender {{Chat option|2About the missing people...}} *Talk to [[Ictus]] north of the Quetzal and west of the nearby hill *Talk to [[Captain Ariadna]] in south-west Auburnvale, between the two guard towers *Talk to [[Francis (Auburnvale)|Francis]] or [[Aemilia]] in the house west of the bar *Inspect the western wall outside of their house then follow path of red marks to the river west of town. *Inspect the plank to use fishing rod (Fishing Rod Spawn just south west of floating plank) to fish up cloth *Return to Francis or Aemilia with the cloth *Follow the path indicated by the puddles west of town, then north around the mountain, until reaching a cave. Enter the cave *Talk to [[injured boy]] *Talk to Francis or Aemilia *Speak to [[Captain Ariadna]] at the West Entrance to town with 4 willow longbows ([[Renu]] to [[Arcuani's Archery Supplies|Tal Teklan Archery shop]] for quick bows) *Reinforce the west Wall of the house with the boys with 4x Maple Logs and a hammer. (Hammer be found in the house to the north. Maple Trees can be chopped nearby.) *Return to Francis or Aemilia, go upstairs and speak to [[Etz]] & [[Shas]] (the former injured boy(s)) *Go back to the cave west of town *Talk to [[Antos]] (east side of the cave) and be prepared to kill 3 [[Strange creature (Shadows of Custodia)|Strange Creatures]] - protect from melee works but you can still take bleed damage. *Talk to Antos again to return to Auburnvale. *Talk to Captain Ariadna *Quest Complete }}
==Rewards== {{Quest rewards |name = Shadows of Custodia |image = [[File:Shadows_of_Custodia_reward_scroll.png|centre]] |qp = 2 |rewards = *{{SCP|Slayer|10,000}} [[Slayer]] experience *{{SCP|Hunter|4,000}} [[Hunter]] experience *{{SCP|Fishing|3,000}} [[Fishing]] experience *{{SCP|Construction|3,000}} [[Construction]] experience * Access to the [[Stalker Den]] containing [[Custodian stalker]]s }}
