{{External|rs=Viyeldi caves|rsc=Viyeldi caves}} {{See also|Viyeldi caves}} {{Infobox Location |name = Shaman Caves |image = [[File:Shaman Caves.png|300px]] |release = [[20 August]] [[2003]] |update = New - Legends Quest! |members = Yes |floors = 1 |location = [[Karamja]] |music = [[Superstition]] |map = {{Map:Viyeldi caves|align=|caption=}} |type = dungeon |leagueRegion = Karamja&Fremennik,Karamja&Kandarin }} The '''Shaman Caves''' are the upper floor of a cave system located in the [[Kharazi Jungle]] in southern [[Karamja]]. They play a large role in [[Legends' Quest]], which must be started in order to access the caves. The entrance to the cave is in the north-western part of the Kharazi Jungle and is accessed by squeezing into the [[mossy rock]], which requires 50 [[Agility]].
The first room of the caves has a [[fire wall]] containing [[Ungadulu]], a shaman possessed by the black demon [[Nezikchened]]. Ungadulu later helps the player reach the deeper sections of the cave, including the deeper [[Viyeldi caves]] accessed via a [[Winch (Viyeldi caves)|winch]] at the end of the dungeon. There is a shortcut on the western wall near the entrance that bypasses a majority of the cave, requiring 96 [[Agility]].
To navigate the caves after the quest (below 96 Agility), bring the following items: {{Checklist| * A [[pickaxe]], * A [[lockpick]], * An [[unpowered orb]], * Runes to cast an [[enchantment]] spell (3 [[cosmic rune]]s and 30 elemental runes). * An [[axe]] and [[machete]] to access the Kharazi Jungle, unless using the level 79 Agility [[Vine (Kharazi Jungle)|shortcut]]. * A [[spade]], if doing a [[master clue scroll]]. }}
The unpowered orb, runes, and a spade are not required to access the [[Death wing|Death Wings]].
To traverse the caves, the following steps must be taken:
# Enter the caves by searching the Rocks in the north-western part of the Kharazi Jungle. #* If you have at least 96 Agility, use the shortcut on the western wall near the entrance of the cave. Skip to step 9. # Search the [[Bookcase (Viyeldi caves)|eastern bookcase]]. # Use a lockpick (note: a [[strange old lockpick]] will not work) on the [[Ancient Gate]] (click out of the dialogue if it states your lockpick breaks and try again) # Smash the three boulders. (Level 52 mining require to smash boulders). # Open the next Ancient Gate. (Level 50 strength require to attempt to move the metal doors). # Jump-over the [[jagged wall]]. # 'Use' the Marked wall on the west side of the room. # Manually cast any [[Charge Orb]] spell on the northern Ancient Gate. # Search, then Climb-down the winch. # Climb-over several rocky ledges, or use the long rope shortcut (with 91 [[Agility]]).
{| |[[File:Legends' Quest - Viyeldi caves entrance.png|thumb|x250px|The entrance to the Shaman Caves.]] |{{Map|2782,2935|r=5|mtype=square|align=left|caption=The cave entrance on the world map.|width=250|height=250}} |} After Legends' Quest, there are two reasons to return to the caves: * A hard task for the [[Karamja Diary]] (kill a [[death wing]]) * A master clue step
==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 8 May 2024 |update = Project Rebalance: Skilling & Poll 81 MTA Changes |change = A new [[Crevice (Shaman Caves)|shortcut]] has been added to the entrance in Shaman Caves. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
==Trivia== * The name of the Shaman Caves is attested in the game message shown when climbing up the [[Climbing rope (Viyeldi caves)|rope]] from the Viyeldi caves: {{mes|You climb back up the rope to the Shaman Caves..{{sic}}}}
{{Dungeons}}

