The '''Shantay Pass Shop''' is a shop owned by [[Shantay]] in the [[Shantay Pass]]. It sells items players might need in the [[Kharidian Desert]], such as [[waterskin]]s, [[knife|knives]], and [[desert clothing]].

The shop can also be accessed from the [[Ruins of Unkah]] by trading the [[Shantay Guard (Ruins of Unkah)|Shantay guards]] there. The stock is shared between Shantay and the two Shantay guards.

