'''Shanty''' may refer to: *NPC **[[Shantay]], the border guard at the [[Shantay Pass]]. **[[Shanty Claws]], a [[werewolf]] sailor located on the west dock of [[Musa Point]] during the [[2013 Christmas event]].
*Music **[[The Last Shanty]] **[[Sea Shanty]] **[[Sea Shanty 2]] **[[Sea Shanty Xmas]]
{{disambig}}

{{External|rs}} {{Gone|update = Minigame Grouping}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Shanty Claws |image = [[File:Shanty Claws.png|160px]] |release = [[17 December]] [[2013]] |update = Christmas Holiday Event |removal = [[9 January]] [[2014]] |removalupdate = Minigame Grouping |members = No |race = [[Werewolf]] |location = [[Musa Point]] during [[2013 Christmas event]] |gender = Male |examine = A sea shanty-singing werewolf wearing a Santa Claus robe. |map = No |id = removed |leagueRegion = No }} [[File:Shanty Claws chathead.png|left]] '''Shanty Claws''' was a [[werewolf]] sailor located on the west dock of [[Musa Point]] during the [[2013 Christmas event]].
As the start point of the [[Holiday events|event]], he tasked players with rescuing [[Jack (Christmas 2013)|Jack]], [[Jill]], and [[Jeff (child)|Jeff]] from the [[gublinch]]. Once the event was completed, he would reward players with a [[reindeer hat]] and a [[wintumber tree]] for their [[player-owned house]].
During the event, a jingle would occasionally play around Shanty Claws. {{Listen|align=left|title=The jingle that played.|desc=|filename=Claws' Shanty (Christmas 2013).ogg}}
==Dialogue== {{hastranscript|speaksin}}
==Trivia== *The name Shanty Claws is a play on the name {{wp|Santa Claus}}. *When spoken to with a [[ring of charos]] equipped, he would say that he did not expect to see another werewolf there. *His name may be a reference to the film ''{{wp|The Nightmare Before Christmas}}'', in which Jack Skellington mishears Santa's name as 'Sandy Claws'. *Shanty Claws' ship is called the ''Seahound''. It was not present in the 2013 Christmas event, and is only mentioned in the [[Transcript:Happy Birthday, Mr Elemental.|17th]] [[Postbag from the Hedge]] *Although Shanty Claws is a [[werewolf]], he claims to not be from [[Morytania]], and that he and his ancestors have been sailors since "the wars".{{CitePostbag|issue=17|author=|letter=7|name=}} *Shanty Claws created the [[black partyhat]] and [[rainbow partyhat]], which were both rewards from the 2013 Christmas event.
==References== {{Reflist}}
{{2013 Christmas event}}

{{External|rs}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Sharathteerk |image = [[File:Sharathteerk.png|200px]] |release = [[21 February]] [[2024]] |update = Defender of Varrock |members = Yes |race = [[Gargoyle]] |quest = [[Defender of Varrock]], [[The Curse of Arrav]] |location = [[Zemouregal's Base]] |examine = Very ugly, but then he is a gargoyle. |map = No |id = 12617 |leagueRegion = No }} [[File:Sharathteerk chathead.png|left]] '''Sharathteerk''' is a [[gargoyle]] and second-in-command to the [[Mahjarrat]] warlord [[Zemouregal]]. He appears alongside Zemouregal in both [[Defender of Varrock]] and [[The Curse of Arrav]]. Unlike most gargoyles, Sharathteerk is capable of speaking and exhibits a fair amount of intelligence, as shown by him attempting to warn Zemouregal about [[Lucien]]'s [[Staff of armadyl#Background and history|recent surge in power]].{{CiteNPC|npc=Sharathteerk|quote=Your cousin grows unusually strong. We should consider allying ourselves to him, maybe even combine forces. [...] I'm telling you, he may be close to finding it.|loc=Defender of Varrock}} Despite this, Zemouregal treats Sharathteerk somewhat poorly, having no regard for his safety.{{CiteNPC|npc=Zemouregal|quote=[Sharathteerk: Zemouregal, this magical mist feels like it's corroding my insides. This seems like a bad idea...] Nonsense! The mist has no side effects.|loc=Defender of Varrock}}
==Dialogue== {{hastranscript|speaksin}}
