{{Infobox Scenery |name = Shattered League Display |image = [[File:Shattered League Display.png|250x250px]] |release = [[22 February]] [[2023]] |update = 10th Birthday Event |members = No |quest = No |location = [[Old School Museum]] |options = None |examine = The Shattered Relics League was the third league and was released on 19th January, 2022. |map = {{Map|x=2975|y=9955|2978,9940|2978,9945|2983,9945|2983,9940|2978,9940|mapID=-1|mtype=polygon}} |id = 47257 }} The '''Shattered League Display''' can be found in the lower level of the [[Old School Museum]]. Players cannot interact with the display, but they can [[examine]] it. [[File:Old School Museum - Shattered League Display.png|thumb|left|350px|The display as seen in-game.]]
