{{Shattered Relics League}}

{{Shattered Relics League Guide Nav}} == Overview == {{Main|pay-to-play Mining training}} [[Mining]] can be unlocked for 5 [[Sage's Renown]].
==Skill synergies== * [[Smithing]] can be unlocked to create armour and weapons from [[ores]] gained by mining. * [[Gem rocks]] are a good source of [[gems]] to use in [[Crafting]].
==Set effects and fragments== ===Fragments=== {| class="wikitable" ! Fragment !! Level !! Description |- | rowspan="3" |[[Mother's Magic Fossils]] | 1 | The chance of obtaining [[Fossil Island fossil|fossil]]s on [[Fossil Island]] and [[Motherlode Mine]] [[golden nugget]]s are increased by 100%. [[Mage Training Arena]] [[pizazz points|points]] received are increased by 100%. |- | 2 | The chance of obtaining [[Fossil Island fossil|fossil]]s on [[Fossil Island]] and [[Motherlode Mine]] [[golden nugget]]s are increased by 200%. [[Mage Training Arena]] [[pizazz points|points]] received are increased by 200%. |- | 3 | The chance of obtaining [[Fossil Island fossil|fossil]]s on [[Fossil Island]] and [[Motherlode Mine]] [[golden nugget]]s are increased by 300%. [[Mage Training Arena]] [[pizazz points|points]] received are increased by 300%. |- | rowspan="3" |[[Molten Miner]] | 1 | 20% chance ore mined will be smelted into a bar (if applicable), granting [[Smithing]] experience regardless of level requirements |- | 2 | 50% chance ore mined will be smelted into a bar (if applicable), granting [[Smithing]] experience regardless of level requirements |- | 3 | All ore mined will be smelted into a bar (if applicable), granting [[Smithing]] experience regardless of level requirements |}
===Set effects=== {| class="wikitable sticky-header" |+ ! style="width:25%;" colspan="2"|Set Effect ! style="width:40%;" | Description ! style="width:10%;" | Fragments required ! style="width:25%;" | Fragments |- |[[File:Greedy Gatherer detail.png|80px|link=Greedy Gatherer]] |[[Greedy Gatherer]] (2) |You gain double resources from Fishing, Woodcutting, Mining and Farming. Experience is granted per resource gathered. |2 |rowspan="2"| * [[Message In A Bottle]] * [[Molten Miner]] * [[Rock Solid]] * [[Certified Farmer]] * [[Chef's Catch]] * [[Slash & Burn]] * [[Just Druid!]] |- |[[File:Greedy Gatherer (4 fragment) detail.png|80px|link=Greedy Gatherer]] |[[Greedy Gatherer]] (3) |You gain triple resources from Fishing, Woodcutting, Mining and Farming. Experience is granted per resource gathered. |3 |}
==Tasks== {{LeagueSync}} {{:Shattered Relics League/Tasks/Mining}}
== Quests == {{Main|Quest_experience_rewards#Mining}} [[Quests]] that reward Mining experience and require no other skill: * [[The Forsaken Tower]] * [[Doric's Quest]] * [[Plague City]]
{{Shattered Relics League}}

{{Shattered Relics League Guide Nav}} == Overview == {{Main|Pay-to-play Ranged training}} [[Ranged]] can be unlocked for free during the tutorial if it is the chosen [[combat]] skill. Otherwise, it will cost 10 [[Sage's Renown]]. During the league, [[archery shops]] wares will be restocked automatically so players will always be able to purchase supplies.
==Skill synergies== * If using Ranged for combat, players will not gain [[Hitpoints]] XP, unless it has been unlocked with 5 Sage's Renown. * [[Hunter]] is the only source for [[Chinchompa (disambiguation)|Chinchompas]]. ==Set effects and fragments== ===Fragments=== {| class="wikitable" ! Fragment !! Level !! Description |- | rowspan="3" |[[Bottomless Quiver]] | 1 | Range ammunition & range weapon charges have a 40% chance to be saved, excluding chinchompas. |- | 2 | Range ammunition & range weapon charges have a 60% chance to be saved, excluding chinchompas. |- | 3 | Range ammunition & range weapon charges have a 90% chance to be saved, excluding chinchompas. |- | rowspan="3" |[[Unholy Ranger]] | 1 | Range attack accuracy increases 30% with 0 prayer point left. |- | 2 | Range attack accuracy increases 60% with 0 prayer point left. |- | 3 | Range attack accuracy increases 100% with 0 prayer point left. |}
===Set effects=== {| class="wikitable align-center-3" |+ !Set Effect !Description !Required Fragments !Related Fragments |- |[[Knife's Edge]] |For every hitpoint missing, the player deals 0.3%/0.6% additional damage in all combat styles. |2/3 |[[Unholy Ranger]] [[Bottomless Quiver]]
|} ==Tasks== {{LeagueSync}} {{:Shattered Relics League/Tasks/Ranged}}
==Quests== {{Main|Quest_experience_rewards#Ranged}}
{{Shattered Relics League}}

