{{Shattered Relics League Guide Nav}}
Not all content is immediately accessible in [[Shattered Relics League]]. Content may be unlocked using Sage's Renown.
==Sage's Renown== Sage's Renown is a new type of currency created for Shattered Relics League that is gained by completing league tasks. It can be used to unlock [[skills]] and [[bosses]] during the league. Renown can also be spent to auto-complete specific [[quests]].
Completing all the league tasks will grant a total of 3,463 points. A total of 1,352 points are required if it is used to unlock all quests, skills, and bosses.
==Skills== [[File:Shattered unlock - Skill.gif|thumb|180px|A player unlocks a skill.]] Locked skills can be trained, but no experience will be granted. For example, players can chop a log without woodcutting unlocked due to it being a level 1 action. Locked skills can also be boosted to beyond level 1.
The total Unlock Cost for all skills is '''190 Sage's Renown.'''
