==Quests== [[File:Shattered unlock - Quest.gif|thumb|180px|A player unlocks a quest group.]] Quests are completable as normal, as long as the skill level requirements are met. Using Sage's Renown, players have the option to auto-complete quests to unlock content more quickly. Renown costs vary based on the difficulty of the quest. The total cost of a quest will include the cost of its pre-requisites if they are also incomplete. However, unlocking a quest will also unlock all its pre-requisites. If there is a league task to complete a quest, purchasing an auto-completion will count for the task. Auto-completing quests will '''not''' grant the experience.
===List of quest costs=== {|class="wikitable align-center-2" ! Difficulty!! Renown cost |- |Novice||2 |- |Intermediate||3 |- |Experienced||4 |- |Master||7 |- |Grandmaster||15 |- |Special||2 |- |Kourend house favour||4 |}
===Storyline breakdown=== This table illustrates the renown cost from point A to point B with autounlocking everything.
Buying every unlock totals '''562 Sage's Renown'''. Each unlock adds up to 985, however due to duplication of quest and task completion it is less.
