{{Infobox Item |name = Shattered cannon ornament kit |image = [[File:Shattered cannon ornament kit.png]] |release = [[16 March]] [[2022]] |update = PvP Arena: Rewards Beta |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = An ornamental kit for the Dwarf multicannon in the style of Leagues III - Shattered Relics. |value = 25000 |weight = 0.100 |exchange = Yes |id = 26528 }} [[File:Shattered cannon ornament kit detail.png|left|130px]] The '''Shattered cannon ornament kit''' is an [[ornament kit]] that changes the appearance of the [[dwarf multicannon]]. This process can be reverted at any time returning the item and ornament kit.
