{{Infobox Item |name = Shattered relics adamant trophy |image = [[File:Shattered relics adamant trophy.png]] |release = [[16 March]] [[2022]] |update = PvP Arena: Rewards Beta |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Destroy |wornoptions = Trophy Emote |destroy = You can reclaim this by speaking to the Leagues Tutor or from your League trophy case. |examine = An Adamant trophy for competing in Leagues III - Shattered Relics |value = 1 |weight = 1.500 |id = 26511 }} [[File:Shattered relics adamant trophy detail.png|left|130px]] The '''Shattered Relics adamant trophy''' is a cosmetic reward that could be obtained by being in the top 20% of players in the Leagues Hiscores by the end of the [[Shattered Relics League]], which required having at least 15,575 League points to do so.
A total of 36,133 players met this threshold by the end of the League.
When equipped, the trophy can be right-clicked to perform the Trophy Emote.
The trophy can be displayed by using it on furniture built in the [[League hall]]'s [[pedestal space]].
If lost, players can reclaim it from the [[Leagues Assistant]], or from furniture built in the League hall's [[trophy case space]].
