{{Infobox Item |name = Shattered relics variety ornament kit |image = [[File:Shattered relics variety ornament kit.png]] |release = [[16 March]] [[2022]] |update = PvP Arena: Rewards Beta |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = A kit that can be used to apply a Leagues III - Shattered Relics theme to an Abyssal whip or Tentacle, Rune crossbow or God book piece. |value = 25000 |weight = 0.100 |exchange = Yes |id = 26421 }} [[File:Shattered relics variety ornament kit detail.png|left|130px]] The '''Shattered relics variety ornament kit''' is an [[ornament kit]] that changes the appearance of the [[abyssal whip]] and [[Abyssal tentacle|tentacle]], the [[rune crossbow]], and all [[god books]]. This process can be reverted at any time returning the item and ornament kit.
It can be purchased from the [[Leagues Reward Shop]] for 1,500 League Points.
