{{External|rs}}
'''Shauna Ravitz''' was a former [[Varrock]]ian belonging to the Ravitz family, descending from the [[Elders of Avarrocka]]. She was the last blood descendant of [[Ramone Ravitz]] within the family. She married into the [[Fitzharmon]] family.{{CiteNPC|npc=Horvik|loc=Defender of Varrock|quote=The last descendant of the Ravitz line was a lady named Shauna Ravitz. She married into the Fitzharmon family.}}

