{{External|rs}} {{Flatpacked version|Shaving stand (flatpack)}} {{Infobox Construction |name = Shaving stand |image = [[File:Shaving stand built.png|150px]] |icon = [[File:Shaving stand icon.png]] |furniturename = Shaving stand |release = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |update = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |level = 21 |experience = 30 |room = [[Bedroom]] |hotspot = [[Dresser space]] |flatpack = Yes |examine = To help you shave. |id = 13162 |itemid = 8045 }} The '''shaving stand''' can be built in the [[dresser space]] of the [[bedroom]] in a [[player-owned house]]. It requires 21 [[Construction]] to build and gives 30 [[experience]] when built. The player must have a [[hammer]] and a [[saw]] in their inventory to build it.
