{{Infobox Location |name = Shayzien Agility Course |image = [[File:Shayzien Agility Course.png]] |release = [[16 June]] [[2021]] |update = A Kingdom Divided |members = Yes |location = [[Shayzien Encampment]] |map = {{Map|1554:3630|plane=0|r=3|mtype=square}} |type = agility course |leagueRegion = Kourend }} The '''Shayzien Agility Course''' is an [[Agility]] [[Agility course|course]] split into a basic and advanced course. The shared starting point is south-west of the [[Kourend Castle]] in the [[Shayzien Encampment]]. Players can check individual and global stats for both courses with the [[Soldier (Shayzien Agility Course)|soldier]] next to the starting ladder. Players can receive [[marks of grace]] during this course.
Completing a lap of the Shayzien Agility Course is an easy task in the [[Kourend & Kebos Diary]].
==Transportation== *[[Fairy rings|Fairy Ring]] code {{Fairycode|DJR}} run south-east *Use the [[Kourend Castle Teleport]] and run south-west into [[Shayzien Encampment]] *Use a [[Watson teleport]] run north-west across the bridge *Use a [[Skills necklace]] and teleport to the [[Woodcutting Guild]] and run north west *Walk from [[Lumbridge]] to [[Veos]]/[[Cabin Boy Herbert]] **Travel to [[Land's End]] run north **Travel to [[Port Piscarilius]] run west **Travel to [[Port Piscarilius]] head west, then north to the [[Lovakengj Minecart Network]] and travel to [[Shayzien]] *Teleport with the [[Xeric's talisman]] **[[Xeric's Lookout]] run north **[[Xeric's Heart]] run south-west into Shayzien *Change your respawn point to [[Kourend Castle]] **Use [[Respawn Teleport]] on the [[Arceuus spellbook]]
==Basic course== This course requires 1 Agility and yields 153.5 Agility [[experience]] for completion.
The basic course takes a minimum of 51.0 seconds to complete, the Agility [[experience]] per hour is at most 10,000. {| class="wikitable align-left-2" style="text-align:center;" |+Experience per obstacle |- !Image !Obstacle !Experience |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (1).png|250px]]||[[Ladder (Shayzien Agility Course)|Ladder]]||{{+=|xp|5.5|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (2).png|250px]]||[[Monkeybars (Shayzien Agility Course)|Monkeybars]]||{{+=|xp|8|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (3).png|250px]]||[[Tightrope (Shayzien Agility Course)|Tightrope]]||{{+=|xp|9|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (4).png|250px]]||[[Bar (Shayzien Agility Course)|Bar]]||{{+=|xp|7|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (5).png|250px]]||[[Tightrope (Shayzien Agility Course)|Tightrope]]||{{+=|xp|9|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (6).png|250px]]||[[Tightrope (Shayzien Agility Course)|Tightrope]]||{{+=|xp|9|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (7).png|250px]]||[[Gap (Shayzien Agility Course)|Gap]]||{{+=|xp|106|echo=2}} |- !colspan=2|Total !{{#var:xp}} |}
==Advanced course== This course requires 45 Agility and yields 507.5 Agility [[experience]] for completion. A [[crossbow]] and a [[mith grapple]] are required to complete this course.{{#vardefine:xp|0}}
The advanced course takes a minimum 46.2 seconds to complete (46.8 if not stopping next to the ladder) and the average Agility experience per hour is at most 30,000. Players can expect to stop failing the obstacles that make up the advanced course at around level 64 Agility.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1425752896507977729|date=12 August 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104257|archivedate=12 June 2023|quote=I reckon about 64.}} {| class="wikitable align-left-2" style="text-align:center;" |+Experience Per Obstacle !Image !Obstacle !Experience |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (1).png|250px]]||[[Ladder (Shayzien Agility Course)|Ladder]]|||{{+=|xp|6|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (2).png|250px]]||[[Monkeybars (Shayzien Agility Course)|Monkeybars]]||{{+=|xp|8|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Basic Course (3).png|250px]]||[[Tightrope (Shayzien Agility Course)|Tightrope]]||{{+=|xp|9|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Advanced Course (4).png|250px]]||[[Beam (Shayzien Agility Course)|Beam]]||{{+=|xp|23|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Advanced Course (5).png|250px]]||[[Edge (Shayzien Agility Course)|Edge]]||{{+=|xp|18|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Advanced Course (6).png|250px]]||[[Edge (Shayzien Agility Course)|Edge]]||{{+=|xp|21|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Advanced Course (7).png|250px]]||[[Beam (Shayzien Agility Course)|Beam]]||{{+=|xp|23|echo=2}} |- |[[File:Shayzien Advanced Course (8).png|250px]]||[[Zipline (Shayzien Agility Course)|Zipline]]||{{+=|xp|400|echo=2}} |- !colspan=2|Total !508 |}
