{{Infobox Item |name = Shayzien body (5) |image = [[File:Shayzien body (5).png]] |release = [[7 January]] [[2016]] |update = Zeah: Great Kourend |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Dress like a tier 5 Shayzien soldier. |value = 80 |weight = 9.979 |id = 13381 |leagueRegion = Kourend }} [[File:Shayzien body (5) detail.png|left|150px]] The '''Shayzien body (5)''' is a body that requires 20 [[Defence]] to equip, and is part of the [[Shayzien armour (tier 5)]] set.
It is dropped by the [[Soldier (tier 5)|tier 5 soldier]] at the [[Combat Ring (Shayzien)|Combat Ring]] in the [[Shayzien Encampment]]. It can also be created at an anvil with 93 [[Smithing]] and 4 [[lovakite bar]]s.
In terms of defensive bonuses, it lies between the [[iron platebody]] and [[steel platebody]].
{{Costume storage|armour case|[[Shayzien armour (tier 5)]] set|set=true}} It can alternatively be stored in a [[STASH]] unit as it is required for an [[Treasure Trails/Guide/Emote clues|Elite clue step]].
