{{Infobox Item |name = Shayzien platebody (4) |image = [[File:Shayzien platebody (4).png]] |release = [[7 January]] [[2016]] |update = Zeah: Great Kourend |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Dress like a tier 4 Shayzien soldier. |value = 70 |weight = 9.979 |id = 13376 |leagueRegion = Kourend }} [[File:Shayzien platebody (4) detail.png|left|150px]] The '''Shayzien platebody (4)''' is a platebody that requires 20 [[Defence]] to equip, and is part of the [[Shayzien armour (tier 4)]] set.
It is dropped by the [[Soldier (tier 4)|tier 4 soldier]] at the [[Combat Ring (Shayzien)|Combat Ring]] in the [[Shayzien Encampment]]. It can also be created at an anvil with 83 [[Smithing]] and 4 [[lovakite bar]]s.
