{{Gone|update = Children of the Sun}} {{Infobox Item |name = Shayzien supply boots (1) |image = [[File:Shayzien supply boots (1).png]] |release = [[7 January]] [[2016]] |update = Zeah: Great Kourend |removal = [[10 January]] [[2024]] |removalupdate = Children of the Sun |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Supplies for the Shayzien soldiers. |value = 10 |weight = 1.360 |id = 13539 }} [[File:Shayzien supply boots (1) detail.png|left|150x150px]] '''Shayzien supply boots (1)''' were unequippable tier 1 [[Shayzien supply armour]] that required 30% [[Lovakengj]] [[favour]], 47 [[Smithing]], and 1 [[lovakite bar]] to smith, yielding 10 Smithing [[experience]].
When delivered to [[armourer (tier 1)]], 0.1% Lovakengj favour, 45 [[Mining]] experience, and 80 Smithing experience were rewarded. However, it was more efficient to deliver a [[Shayzien supply set (1)]], rewarding 1.5% Lovakengj favour, 675 Mining experience (691.9 wearing full [[Prospector kit]]), and 1200 Smithing experience. ==Creation== {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 47 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 10 |notes = {{SCP|Favour}} 30% [[Lovakengj]] [[favour]] |members = Yes |ticks = 4 |ticksnote = Make-X is 4, then 5 ticks |tools = Hammer |facilities = Anvil |bucket = No |mat1 = Lovakite bar |mat1cost = No |output1 = Shayzien supply boots (1) |output1cost = No }}
