Duplicates can be [[drop trick]]ed by searching the open chest to obtain another. After leaving the room, all copies in the inventory are deleted.
{{Recruitment Drive}}

'''Shed''' may refer to:
*The [[Shed key]] used in the [[Creature of Fenkenstrain]] [[quest]] to open the shed in the backyard of [[Fenkenstrain's Castle]]. *The [[Key (Witch's House)|Key]] used in the [[Witch's House]] quest to open her shed. *The gardening shed on the grounds of [[Sinclair Mansion]]. *The shed near [[Edgeville]] that is unlocked with the [[Brass key]] to get into the [[Edgeville Dungeon]]. *The shed near [[Grim]]'s house during the [[2015 Halloween event]]. *The shed leading to [[Zanaris]] in the [[Lumbridge Swamp]]. *[[Tool Leprechaun]]s were originally said to teleport your stored items into the Lumbridge Swamp shed.
{{Disambig}}

