{{Otheruses|the item|the scenery object|Caged monkey (Sheep)}} {{Gone|update=Shooting Stars}} {{Infobox Item |name = Sheep's caged monkey |image = [[File:Sheep's caged monkey.png]] |release = [[17 February]] [[2021]] |update = 8th Birthday Event and LMS Changes |removal = [[17 March]] [[2021]] |removalupdate = Shooting Stars |members = No |quest = [[2021 Birthday event]] |tradeable = No |bankable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Talk-to, Release |destroy = ''Release'' - You will have to recover it from sheep again. |examine = A monkey trapped in a crate. |value = 0 |alchable = No |weight = 1.500 |id = hist25513 }} [[File:Sheep's caged monkey detail.png|left|120px]] [[File:Monkey on unicorn chathead.png|left]] '''Sheep's caged monkey''' is a [[monkey cage]] containing the monkey that was on a [[Sheep (2021 Birthday event)|sheep]]'s back during the [[2021 Birthday event]]. To catch the monkey, the cage must be placed near the sheep with a monkey on its back or used on it, at which point a cutscene will play of the monkey being lured into the cage.
The caged monkey cannot be deposited into a bank. If players try to bank it, the chatbox will state "A magical force prevents you from banking this item!" On death, the caged monkey is always deleted from the player's inventory.
==Transcript== {{Hastranscript|item}}
{{2021 Birthday event}}

{{Otheruses|the [[2021 Birthday event]] NPC|an animal|Sheep}} {{Gone|update=Shooting Stars}} {{Infobox NPC |version1 = Monkey on sheep |version2 = Sheep |name = Sheep |image1 = [[File:Sheep (with monkey).png|120px]] |image2 = [[File:Sheep (dark grey, 1).png|120px]] |release = [[18 February]] [[2021]] |update = 8th Birthday Event and LMS Changes |removal = [[17 March]] [[2021]] |removalupdate = Shooting Stars |members = No |race1 = [[Monkey]], [[Sheep]] |race2 = [[Sheep]] |quest = [[2021 Birthday event]] |location = [[Lumbridge]] |examine1 = Aww... how adorable! I almost don't want to disturb him. |examine2 = I almost feel bad having seperated{{sic}} them, I'm sure they would've been good friends. |map1 = {{Map|x=3208|y=3270|mtype=pin|ptype=npc}} |map2 = No |id1 = hist10616,hist10578,10594,hist10595,hist10596 |id2 = hist10597 |leagueRegion = No }} '''Sheep''' was a character found in [[Fred the Farmer]]'s sheep pen during the [[2021 Birthday event]]. The sheep had a sleeping [[monkey]] on its back. During the event the player captured the monkey on the sheep's back.
The sheep was stationary and did not move. After capturing the monkey on the sheep's back, the player would receive a [[Sheep's caged monkey]].
[[File:Sheep (2021 Birthday event).gif|thumb|left|The monkey almost falling off the sheep's back.]]
