The '''Shellbane Gryphon Cave''' is a dungeon found on [[The Great Conch]] and is home to the [[Shellbane gryphon]] boss. The cave entrance is protected by [[Elder Nama]], who prevents players from entering unless they have an appropriate [[slayer task]] or an [[elite clue scroll]] directing them to kill the shellbane gryphon. Although the cave is a [[multicombat area]], the boss fight takes place in a solo [[instance]].

The entrance to the cave is north of the fairy ring {{Fairycode|CJQ}}. Players may not place a [[dwarf multicannon]] or light a [[fire]] within the cave; attempting to do so produces the messages {{mes|The ground is too unstable to set up a cannon here.}} and {{mes|The ground is too unstable to light a fire here.}} respectively.


