The '''shellbane gryphon''' is a monster fought during the [[Troubled Tortugans]]. It is the quest version of the [[Shellbane gryphon|Slayer boss]] of the same name.
The shellbane gryphon attacks with both melee and ranged, and its damage can be negated with [[Protect from Melee]] when next to the player while wearing the [[Tortugan shield]] and [[Protect from Missiles]] when more than one tile away. It has multiple avoidable attacks.
{| class="wikitable" !Attack !Attack !Negation |- |Slam |The gryphon will knock the player back and dealing heavy damage if [[Weight|worn weight]] is less than 40kg. |Stand behind a tree or eggs. |- |Whirlwinds |The gryphon will flap its wings, creating whirlwinds on the player's location that can hit for 50+. |Step at least one tile away from the winds. |- |Corrosive spit |The gryphon will spit orange acid on the player's current tile, causing a [[corrosion]] effect. |Step at least one tile away from the spit. |}
