==Transportation== * [[Mooring point]]
==Features== * A [[Hunter]] training spot containing [[tropical wagtail]] and [[black warlock]]. * [[Tarnished chest]]. * A [[Lockbox (Shimmering Atoll)|lockbox]] containing the [[Lost schematics|schematics]] for the [[Rosewood hull]]. * [[Mahogany]] and [[teak]] trees.
The lockbox is opened with a key obtained by digging south-west of the starfish by the mooring point on the [[Isle of Bones]]. Interacting with the lockbox without this key will produce a set of [[Lockbox directions (shimmering atoll)|lockbox directions]] with a clue to its location. These directions '''are not''' required to obtain the key otherwise.
A [[Medallion fragment]] can be obtained by successfully chopping any teak tree once.
A decorative [[Katana (scenery)|katana]] can be found in the northern banks of the atoll.
==Woodcutting== {| class="wikitable sortable align-center-1 align-left-2" style="text-align:right;" ! rowspan=2 colspan=2 | Tree ! colspan=2 | {{SCP|Woodcutting}} [[Woodcutting]] ! rowspan=2 | Quantity |- !Level !Exp |- |{{plinkp|Teak logs}}||[[Teak tree|Teak]] |35||85||5 |- |{{plinkp|Mahogany logs}}||[[Mahogany tree|Mahogany]] |50||125||2 |- |}
