{{Infobox Scenery |name = Shimmering barrier |image = [[File:Shimmering barrier.png|250x250px]] |release = [[5 January]] [[2017]] |update = Chambers of Xeric |members = Yes |quest = No |location = [[Chambers of Xeric]] |options = Dispel |examine = I wonder if there is something that can dispel this? |map = No |id = 29749 |leagueRegion = Kourend }} A '''shimmering barrier''' can be found within the [[Chambers of Xeric/Strategies#Tightrope)|tightrope room]] during a [[Chambers of Xeric]] raid. The barrier is blocking the path to the next room, and must be dispelled with a [[keystone crystal]]. The keystone is obtainable by successfully and safely crossing the [[tightrope (Chambers of Xeric)|tightrope]] within the room. Points for the raid will be awarded to the player dispelling the barrier.
When the barrier is dispelled with the keystone, any surviving enemies will be killed.
