==Trivia==
* If the player does not have enough inventory space when receiving multiple unstackable items from looting the corpse of an enemy at sea, all looted items are dropped on the floor under the player. For example, if receiving 5 [[mahogany plank]]s from a [[Vampyre kraken]] while having only 4 empty inventory spaces, all planks will be dropped onto the floor.

