The '''ship in a bottle''' is a [[sea charting]] object found in the [[Pearl Bank]], south of [[The Little Pearl]].

Upon charting the object, a game message appears stating {{mes|The bottle seems to be a model of one of the nearby wrecked ships. You note the location down.}}

