{{External|rs|rsc=Ship Ticket}} {{Infobox Item |name = Ship ticket |image = [[File:Ship ticket.png]] |release = [[27 January]] [[2003]] |update = Shilo Village Quest online |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = Allows you passage on the 'Lady of the waves' ship. |value = 5 |weight = 0.004 |exchange = Yes |id = 621 }} [[File:Ship ticket detail.png|left|130px]] '''Ship tickets''' are tickets for the [[Lady of the Waves]]. It can be exchanged to [[Captain Shanks]] for a boat ride to [[Port Khazard]] or [[Port Sarim]].
They can be purchased in [[Shilo Village (location)|Shilo Village]] from [[Seravel]] above the fishing shop north of the entrance. They can also be purchased from [[Captain Shanks]] who sells it for a varying price (usually between 26-45 coins).
Ship tickets can sometimes be found inside [[Barrel (Shaman Caves)|barrel]]s in the [[Shaman Caves]], visited during [[Legends' Quest]].
