'''Shipwreck''' may refer to:
* [[Shipwreck salvaging]], low-intensity activity in Sailing skill * [[Shipwreck Cove]], location north of Varlamore * [[Shipwrecked]], music track
{{Disambig}}

{{Redirect|Shipwreck}}
[[File:Shipwreck salvaging icon.png|left]]
[[File:Shipwreck salvaging.png|thumb|300px|A player's crew salvaging from mercenary shipwrecks whilst they sort the salvage.]]
'''Shipwreck salvaging''' is a low-intensity gathering activity in [[Sailing]] where players move adjacent to [[File:Salvaging spot icon.png]] shipwrecks across the ocean, deploy their [[salvaging hook]], and collect [[salvage]] for small amounts of Sailing experience. [[Crew Management|Crewmates]] can be commanded to operate salvaging hooks for reduced experience.

Notable resources from shipwreck salvaging include [[Sailing resources#Farming|farming seeds]], [[salvaging relic|salvaging relics]], the [[Boat bottle]], the [[Facility bottle]], the [[Sailors' amulet]], and dragon materials for [[shipbuilding]]. 

