===Two crewmate efficient sloop setup===
[[Dragon salvaging hook]]s can only be operated by Crewmates with +4 [[Deckhandiness]]. As [[Cabin Boy Jenkins (ghost)|Cabin Boy Jenkins]] and [[Jolly Jim]] are the only two crewmates that meet that requirement, both are required if the player wishes to assign crewmates to two dragon salvaging hooks at the same time.

The ideal setup for using both hooks with the help of 2 Crewmates whilst also using the crystal extractor is as follows:
