'''Shipwrights''' are [[Non-player character|NPCs]] found at large [[Mooring point|ports]]. They offer several boat-related services such as: 

* Buying a new boat
* Destroying an existing boat 
* [[Shipbuilding|Customising]] an existing boat 
* Retrieving a boat that has capsized or is at another port

If the requirements to dock at a Shipwrights respective port are not met, the only assistance they will provide is the option to destroy a boat.

At low levels the fastest means of accessing a bank and shipwright via teleport is by using [[Catherby Teleport]] or a [[Catherby teleport (tablet)]].

Shipwrights are always paired with a [[Shipwrights' Workbench]].

At level 67, [[Deepfin Point]] becomes fastest if you have a [[sailors' amulet]].

