He can repair your boat for 50 coins per hitpoint, which costs ~25% more than buying [[repair kit]]s from his store. The repair fee can be taken directly from a players bank if a player is not carrying enough coins for the repair. 

Unlike other Shipwrights, he cannot be used to buy new boats or destroy existing ones.

