The '''Shipyard''' is an island located in the [[Shrouded Ocean]], south-west of the [[Isle of Souls]], where [[boats]] can be [[Shipbuilding|customised]]. The location can be sailed to directly, but an invisible barrier outside the harbour prevents players' ships from docking. Instead, it must be accessed by teleporting from a port.

==Transportation==
To travel to the island, speak to any [[Shipwright]] at a port or select the "Customise-boat" right-click option. Your boat '''must''' be docked in the same port as the shipwright. Note that not all ports have a shipwright.

Before level 20 [[Sailing]], the fastest means of accessing a bank and shipwright via teleport is by using a [[Catherby Teleport]] or a [[Catherby teleport (tablet)]]. At level 67, [[Deepfin Point]] becomes fastest with a [[Sailors' amulet]]. 

