==Trivia==
* A version of the Shipyard existed in the [[March 2025 Sailing Alpha]] and [[June 2025 Sailing Beta]]. It was an instanced copy of the [[Shipyard (Karamja)|shipyard]] on [[Karamja]], accessed by speaking to any [[Shipwright]]. During the pre-release periods, unlimited supplies were provided in the shipyard to upgrade boats and build [[facilities]], and the [[Shipyard Portal]] transported players back from the shipyard.

