If the player wears the correct gear (a [[hard hat]] or [[carpenter's helmet]] for those mentioning headgear, or [[builder's boots]] or [[carpenter's boots]] for those complaining about footwear), they will offer the player a [[cup of tea]] as an apparent distraction from their own uniform when the player attempts to point it out.
