[[File:Shiratti the Custodian chathead.png|left]]
'''Shiratti the Custodian''' is the curatrix of the Temple of [[Elidinis]] in [[Nardah]], guarding the [[Elidinis statuette]]. She plays a small role in the [[Spirits of the Elid]] [[quests|quest]]. She can be found in the building directly north of the water fountain located in the centre of Nardah.

As the town lacks a priestess of Elidinis, she is de facto responsible for the Nardarine religious affairs. She has been waiting for [[Menaphos]] to dispatch a new priestess to Nardah for five years now.{{CiteNPC|npc=Shiratti the Custodian|quote=What do those bureaucratic fools in Menaphos expect! If they're going to take so long to send us a new priestess of She. Do you know we haven't had one for five years now!|loc=|notes=|name=}}

