The '''gems shop counter''' is a unique [[gem stall]] found in [[Mor Ul Rek]]. The stall is owned by [[TzHaar-Hur-Rin]] as part of [[TzHaar-Hur-Rin's Ore and Gem Store]] and players can steal from it if they have a [[Thieving]] level of 75 or higher. A variety of gems can be stolen and unlike other gem stalls they have a chance to be cut rather than uncut. There is a respawn time of 105 seconds. 

==Thieving info==
{{Thieving info
|name = Shop Counter
|level = 75
|xp = 408
|type = Stall
|time = 105 seconds
}}

===Mor Ul Rek===
After thieving you cannot trade with [[TzHaar-Hur-Rin]] for 30 minutes.

{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1260286187400572928|date=12 May 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/106370|archivedate=29 May 2020|quote=First, those role 1/50k for an onyx. If that fails, they roll out of 1000:
1 - dragonstone
49 - diamond
150 - ruby
300 - emerald
500 - sapphire
The chance is 2/3 of the gem being [uncut].<!--The cited tweet states banknoted, but was later corrected to mean cut: https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1260477262769553414-->}}

====Pre-roll====
{{DropsTableHead}}
{{DropsLineSkill|name=Uncut onyx|quantity=1|rarity=1/75000|skill=Thieving}}
{{DropsLineSkill|name=Onyx|quantity=1|rarity=1/150000|skill=Thieving}}
{{DropsTableBottom}}

If the roll for an onyx fails (49,999/50,000), you then roll for the remaining gem types.

Once you have rolled a gem you then roll again to decide if it's cut or uncut, with it being uncut 2/3 of the time.

Obtaining an onyx from the gem stall does '''not''' record an entry in the [[Collection Log]], but will print the message {{Mes|You steal an (uncut) onyx! Wow!}}

