|leagueRegion = Desert
}}
The '''Shop of Distaste''' is a shop in the [[Emir's Arena]], right next to the bank. All they sell is [[rotten tomato]]es, which can be bought from the shopkeeper, [[Fadli]], for one coin each. The rotten tomatoes can be thrown at player characters while they're fighting, but not when they are fighting you. They can only be thrown at people from the sides of the Emir's Arena, at people within the arena. The shop also has a counterpart person over at the banking, with whom you can bank, collect, or trade for rotten tomatoes. This shop serves a similar purpose to the [[Pelters' Veg Stall]] found near [[pillory|pillories]].

Although of limited use, rotten tomatoes are used in the quest [[Recipe for Disaster]] and [[Mourning's End Part II]].

