{{Infobox Task |name = Shopaholic |image = [[File:Shopaholic.jpg]] [[File:Shopaholic (unlocked).jpg]] |task = Visit the General Stores in Lumbridge, Falador, Varrock, Edgeville, Rimmington, Al-kharid and Karamja (Musa point) |aka = |members = No |release = [[24 February]] [[2021]] |update = Old School RuneScape on Steam - Out Now! |area = Varied |reward = None |diary = [[Steam achievements]] |difficulty = None |npc = None }}
'''Shopaholic''' is a [[Steam achievement]] task, which requires the player to ''Visit the [[General Store]]s in [[Lumbridge]], [[Falador]], [[Varrock]], [[Edgeville]], [[Rimmington]], [[Al Kharid|Al-kharid]] and [[Musa Point|Karamja (Musa point)]]'' to be completed. The order in which these stores are visited does not matter for the completion of this achievement. Players only need to enter the store building to make progress towards this achievement.
Note that the Steam Community page may not accurately track the completion of this achievement. Once all of the stores have been visited, players will receive this achievement even if Steam did not accurately track the amount of stores visited before this point.
The recommended order to complete this achievement, other than through casual gameplay, is as follows: {{Checklist| * [[Lumbridge]] — Recommended to buy a [[spade]] for the [[X Marks the Spot]] quest. * [[Al Kharid]] — Recommended to start [[Prince Ali Rescue]] while in the city. * [[Varrock]] — Recommended to visit [[Thessalia]]'s [[Thessalia's Fine Clothes.|clothes store]] across the street for the [[FashionScape]] achievement. * [[Edgeville]] — Can be reached by going around the west wall of the [[Grand Exchange]] * [[Falador]] — Walk south-west from Edgeville to reach Falador. * [[Rimmington]] — Continue south from Falador. Recommended to craft [[air rune]]s on the way to Rimmington to complete the [[Breath of Fresh Air]] achievement. * [[Musa Point|Karamja]] — Take the boat from [[Port Sarim]] ({{Coins|30}} coins). Also the location for the [[Fisherman's Friend]] achievement. }}
{{Map|name=General stores|mtype=pin|caption=A map of all required [[general store]]s. |x=3211|y=3248|width=500|height=500 |x:3211,y:3248,title:[[Lumbridge]] general store,desc: |x:3315,y:3182,title:[[Al Kharid]] general store,desc: |x:3217,y:3415,title:[[Varrock]] general store,desc: |x:3080,y:3510,title:[[Edgeville]] general store,desc: |x:2958,y:3388,title:[[Falador]] general store,desc: |x:2948,y:3216,title:[[Rimmington]] general store,desc: |x:2905,y:3148,title:[[Musa Point|Karamja]] general store,desc: }}
