'''Shortbows''' are two-handed [[bow]]s that fire [[arrows]]. They fire faster than [[Longbow (weapon)|longbows]] and [[composite bow]]s but have a shorter range.

The [[attack range]] of nearly all shortbows is 7 tiles, and 9 when using longrange. The only exception to this is the [[cursed goblin bow]], which has an attack range of 6, and 8 when using longrange.

