'''Shorts''' may refer to:
*[[Lederhosen shorts]], a reward from the [[Freaky Forester]] [[random event]] *[[Shorts (Keldagrim)]], a piece of clothing that can be bought from two stores in [[Keldagrim]] and from one in the underground village of [[Miscellania and Etceteria Dungeon]]
{{Disambig}}

{{External|rs}}
'''Shorts''' are sold in [[Keldagrim]] at [[Vermundi's Clothes Stall]] (brown) and [[Agmundi Quality Clothes]] (blue and yellow). The blue and yellow versions can also be bought at the [[Miscellanian Clothes Shop]] in [[Miscellania]], although this requires partial completion of [[Royal Trouble]]. They are purely for decoration.

The clothes are specifically made for dwarves but [[Agmundi]] does sell the clothes to the few humans who come past her shop in Keldagrim. The skirts are made by Agmundi's sister, [[Vermundi]].

