{{Infobox Scenery |name = Shrine |image = [[File:Shrine (Wyvern Cave).png|250x250px]] |release = [[7 September]] [[2017]] |update = Fossil Island |members = Yes |quest = None |location = [[Wyvern Cave#Northern cave|Northern Wyvern Cave]] |options = None |examine = Forcae castil draekeun. Ortha lokur. Lith kletter ortha lokur. Draekeun fia Lithkren. |map = {{Map|x = 3597|y = 10276|mtype=pin|mapID=-1}} |id = 30851 }} A '''Shrine''' with [[dragonkin]] writings and symbols can be found in the northern [[Wyvern Cave]] on [[Fossil island]]. Upon examining the shrine, the chatbox will state ''Forcae castil draekeun. Ortha lokur. Lith kletter ortha lokur. Draekeun fia Lithkren.''
Using translations found in ''{{RSL|RuneScape}}'', the examine text can be roughly translated as ''Forcae combine dragon. First steel. Superior green first steel. Dragon safe from Lithkren''. {{RSL|Forcae}} is the name of the dragonkin who created [[metal dragons]], while [[Lithkren]] is the name of the fortress built by [[Zorgoth]].
[[File:Wyvern Cave dragonkin shrine.png|thumb|left|The dragonkin shrine as seen in the [[Wyvern Cave]].]] {{Places of worship}}

{{Infobox Scenery |version1 = Sun |version2 = Moon |name = Shrine of Ralos |image1 = [[File:Shrine of Ralos (sun).png|200px]] |image2 = [[File:Shrine of Ralos (moon).png|200px]] |release = [[20 March]] [[2024]] |update = Varlamore: Part One |members = Yes |quest = No |location = [[Varlamore]] |options = Bask |examine = A glorious shrine to the mighty sun god, Ralos. |map = {{Map |x:1701,y:3085 |x:1569,y:3166 |x:1449,y:3171 |x:1734,y:2927 |x:1681,y:3031 |mtype = pin |ptype = object |zoom = -1}} |id1 = 52405 |id2 = 52413 }} '''Shrines of Ralos''' are [[altar]]s to [[Ralos]] that can be found across [[Varlamore]]. They are used to create [[sunfire rune]]s and to upgrade [[Dizana's quiver]] using 150,000 [[sunfire splinters]]. The shrine located at [[The Teomat]] is often used when [[Pay-to-play_Prayer_training#Offering_blessed_bone_shards_to_the_libation_bowl|offering bone shards]].
