{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Shrunk ogleroot |image = [[File:Shrunk ogleroot 1.png]] [[File:Shrunk ogleroot 2.png]] [[File:Shrunk ogleroot 3.png]] [[File:Shrunk ogleroot 4.png]] [[File:Shrunk ogleroot 5.png]] |release = [[4 June]] [[2007]] |update = Grim Tales |members = Yes |quest = [[Grim Tales]] |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Eat, Drop |examine = A shrunk ogleroot! How odd... |value = 2 |weight = 0.000 |exchange = Yes |id = 11205 }} [[File:Shrunk ogleroot detail.png|left|100px]] '''Shrunk ogleroot''' can be found in the witch's house in [[Taverley]] by playing the [[Piano (Witch's House)|piano]], as part of the [[Grim Tales]] [[quest]], or as a drop from an [[Experiment No.2]] down the [[manhole (witch's house)|manhole]] near the entrance to [[witch's house (location)|the witch's house]]. Although they have an "Eat" option, shrunk ogleroots may not be eaten, attempting to do so will result in the message "''You attempt to take a bite out of the ogleroot. It tastes vile and you immediately spit it out.''".
This is the second ingredient of [[shrink-me-quick]] potion used during Grim Tales quest. ==Products== {{Uses material list|Shrunk ogleroot}} ==Item sources== {{Drop sources|Shrunk ogleroot}}
==Gallery== <gallery captionalign="center" widths="120"> Shrunk ogleroot 1 detail.png|One shrunk ogleroot Shrunk ogleroot 2 detail.png|Two shrunk ogleroots Shrunk ogleroot 3 detail.png|Three shrunk ogleroots Shrunk ogleroot 4 detail.png|Four shrunk ogleroots Shrunk ogleroot detail.png|Five shrunk ogleroots </gallery>
{{Grim Tales}} {{Herblore secondaries}}

{{Infobox NPC |name = Shura |image = [[File:Shura.png|140px]] |release = [[6 February]] [[2020]] |update = The Nightmare of Ashihama |members = Yes |race = [[Siren]] |location = [[Sisterhood Sanctuary]] |gender = Female |examine = A siren from the far east. |map = {{Map|name=Shura|x=3808|y=9744|r=4|mapID=14|mtype=square}} |id = 9413,9414 |leagueRegion = Morytania }} [[File:Shura chathead.png|left]] '''Shura''' is a [[siren]] who acts as an [[Item Retrieval Service]] for players to reclaim their lost items after a [[Mo Kal|death]] when fighting [[The Nightmare]]. Retrieving items costs 60,000 [[coins]]. Note that if the player dies a second time '''anywhere''' without reclaiming the items Shura is holding, they will be '''permanently''' lost, unless the death occurs within a safe [[minigame]], such as the [[TzHaar Fight Cave]]. [[Sister Senga]] takes her role as the Item Retrieval Service for the [[Phosani's Nightmare]] variant of the fight.
Shura is a [[siren]] from [[Ashihama]], an island in the [[Pincers]] region of the [[Eastern Lands]]. Found in the [[Sisterhood Sanctuary]] under [[Slepe]], she was pursuing [[The Nightmare]] after successfully driving her away from Ashihama.
==Dialogue== {{hastranscript|NPC}}
==Gallery== <gallery captionalign="center" widths="180"> Shura concept art.png|Concept art of Shura, created by Mod Gee </gallery>
==Trivia== * Shura mentions to the player that her kind believes in ''Mo Kal'', meaning "anything bad that could happen, will happen", sharing similarity as its real-life counterpart {{wp|Murphy's law}}.
{{The Nightmare}} {{Slepe}}

