{{External|rsc|rs}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Sigbert the Adventurer |image = [[File:Sigbert the Adventurer.png|120px]] |release = [[12 December]] [[2002]] |update = Agility skill online |members = Yes |race = [[Human]] |location = At the end of Yanille Agility Dungeon. |gender = Male |options = Talk-to |examine = A bold knight famed for his travels. |map = {{Map|name=Sigbert the Adventurer|2614,9507|mapID=27|r=3|mtype=square}} |id = 5423 |leagueRegion = Kandarin }} [[File:Sigbert the Adventurer chathead.png|left]] '''Sigbert the Adventurer''' is located in the [[Yanille Agility Dungeon]]. When talked to, he warns the player about the power of [[Salarin the twisted]].
