{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of arcane swiftness |image1 = [[File:Sigil of arcane swiftness.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of arcane swiftness (attuned).png]] |release = [[17 July]] [[2024]] |update = Deadman: Armageddon & While Guthix Sleeps Updates |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = All magic weapons with a base attack speed above 4 will have it reduced by 1. Cannot be used in conjunction with the Sigil of the Swashbuckler or the Sigil of the Gunslinger. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 29679 |id2 = 29678 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of arcane swiftness detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of arcane swiftness (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of Arcane Swiftness''' is a tier 2 [[Deadman Mode]] combat sigil. It is an attunable sigil that reduces the [[attack speed]] of 5-tick or slower [[Magic]] weapons or spells by 1. It cannot be used with the [[Sigil of the Swashbuckler]] or the [[Sigil of the Gunslinger]].
