In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |All magic weapons with a base attack speed above 4 will have it reduced by 1. Cannot be used in conjunction with the [[Sigil of the Swashbuckler]] or the [[Sigil of the Gunslinger]]. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |All magic weapons with a base attack speed above 4 will have it reduced by 1. |}
