{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of efficiency |image1 = [[File:Sigil of efficiency.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of efficiency (attuned).png]] |release = [[21 January]] [[2026]] |update = Holy Moleys and the Hooded Slayer Helm are Here! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |bankable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Unlock, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = |examine1 = On failing to chop a tree or catch a fish, you will have a separate 50% chance to succeed. Resources from Woodcutting, Fishing and Farming will be doubled. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |alchable = No |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 33062 |id2 = 33061 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of efficiency detail.png|130px|left]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of efficiency (attuned) detail.png|130px|left]] }} The '''Sigil of Efficiency''' is a skilling [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is a permanent unlock that doubles resources gained from [[Woodcutting]], [[Fishing]], and [[Farming]], as well as increases the chance to succeed when chopping trees and catching fish.
