{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of nature |image1 = [[File:Sigil of nature.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of nature (attuned).png]] |release = [[25 August]] [[2021]] |update = Deadman: Reborn |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Unlock, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Choose your own Farming Contracts. Farming patches will grow instantly and never catch diseases. Does not work at Tithe Farm. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 26096 |id2 = 26095 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of nature detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of nature (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of Nature''' is a tier 2 skilling [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is a permanent unlock that allows a player to choose their own [[farming contracts]], as well as causes [[Farming/Patch locations|farming patches]] to grow instantly and never become [[Disease (Farming)|diseased]]. It '''does not''' work at [[Tithe Farm]]. Although you can choose your own farming contracts, you cannot pick the same contract twice in a row.
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], it can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune'' and is a permanent unlock. There is no limit on how many permanent sigils can be active at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using it on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Choose your own [[Farming Contracts]]. Farming patches will grow instantly and never catch diseases. Does not work at Tithe Farm. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Choose your own Farming Contracts. Farming cycles occur every minute instead of every five minutes, allowing crops to grow 5x quicker. |- |[[Deadman: Apocalypse]] |Choose your own Farming Contracts. Farming cycles occur every minute instead of every five minutes, allowing crops to grow 5x quicker. |- |[[Deadman: Reborn]] |Choose your own Farming Contracts. |}
