{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of pious protection |image1 = [[File:Sigil of pious protection.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of pious protection (attuned).png]] |release = [[25 August]] [[2021]] |update = Deadman: Reborn |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Decrease the amount of damage you take from attacks of a given combat style by 35% when using the correct protection prayer for that style. Increase the damage you take by protecting against the wrong combat style by 5%. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 26129 |id2 = 26128 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of pious protection detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of pious protection (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of Pious Protection''' is a tier 3 combat [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is an attunable sigil that decreases damage taken from attacks by 35% when using the correct [[protection prayer]] for that combat style, but increases damage taken by 5% if using the wrong [[protection prayer]]. The damage reduction gained from the sigil scales multiplicatively with the damage reduction gained from a protection prayer.{{CiteDiscord|author=Mod Ash|url=https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/431834766325841920/1471548494970884202|date=12 February 2026|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27962750#chat-messages-431834766325841920-1471548494970884202|archivedate=7 March 2026|quote=It's calculated multiplicatively: First the sigil's modifier is applied, then the result is rounded to an integer, then that integer is multiplied down further by the prayer modifier.|image=Ash Sigil of pious protection scaling.png|ctximage=Ash Sigil of pious protection scaling (query).png|ctxquote=Hi all I was curious if there is a clarification on if Sigil of Pious protection is additive or multiplicative with protection prayers, e.g. would ruinous overheads cause you to have: 40%+35%=75% DR, or (40)*(35)=~61% DR? (...)}}
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], the un-attuned version can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune''. Up to three attunable sigils can be attuned at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using them on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Decrease the amount of damage you take from attacks of a given combat style by 35% when using the correct protection prayer for that style. Increase the damage you take by protecting against the wrong combat style by 5%. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Decrease the amount of damage you take from attacks of a given combat style by 35% when using the correct protection Prayer for that style. Increase the damage you take by protecting against the wrong combat style by 5%. |- |[[Deadman: Apocalypse]] |Decrease the amount of damage you take from attacks of a given combat style by 25% when using the correct protection Prayer for that style. Increase the damage you take by protecting against the wrong combat style by 5%. |- |[[Deadman: Reborn]] |Decrease the amount of damage you take from attacks of a given combat style by 30% when using the correct protection prayer for that style. Increase the damage you take by protecting against the wrong combat style by 40%. |}
