{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of rampage |image1 = [[File:Sigil of rampage.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of rampage (attuned).png]] |release = [[25 August]] [[2021]] |update = Deadman: Reborn |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Alternating combat styles will increase your rampage count, up to a maximum of 2. Consecutive attacks with the same style will reset the counter. Each rampage count increases your damage and accuracy by 7%. Your rampage count will reset after not attacking for 6 seconds. This sigil does not stack with the Sigil of Aggression. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 26135 |id2 = 26134 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of rampage detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of rampage (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of Rampage''' is a tier 3 combat [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is an attunable sigil that increases damage and accuracy when switching combat styles each attack. Consective attacks with the same combat style will reset the counter.
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], the un-attuned version can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune''. Up to three attunable sigils can be attuned at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using them on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Alternating combat styles will increase your rampage count, up to a maximum of 2. Consecutive attacks with the same style will reset the counter. Each rampage count increases your damage and accuracy by 7%. Your rampage count will reset after not attacking for 6 seconds. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Alternating combat styles will increase your rampage count, up to a maximum of 3. Consecutive attacks with the same style will reset the counter. Each rampage count increases your damage and accuracy by 3%. Your rampage count will reset after not attacking for 6 seconds. The damage bonus effect does not stack with the [[Sigil of Aggression]]. |- |[[Deadman: Apocalypse]] |Alternating combat styles will increase your rampage count, up to a maximum of 5. Consecutive attacks with the same style will reset the counter. Each rampage count increases your damage and accuracy by 2%. Your rampage count will reset after not attacking for 12 seconds. The damage bonus effect does not stack with the Sigil of Aggression. |- |[[Deadman: Reborn]] |Alternating combat styles will increase your rampage count, up to a maximum of 5. Consecutive attacks with the same style will reset the counter. Each rampage count increases your damage and accuracy by +5%. |}
