{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of restoration |image1 = [[File:Sigil of restoration.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of restoration (attuned).png]] |release = [[17 July]] [[2024]] |update = Deadman: Armageddon & While Guthix Sleeps Updates |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Unlock, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Upon a successful hit, your Hitpoints are restored by 10% of the damage dealt, rounded up. Excludes attacks on multiple targets and special attacks. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 29670 |id2 = 29669 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of restoration detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of restoration (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of Restoration''' is a tier 2 combat [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. Upon a successful hit, your [[Hitpoints]] are restored by 10% of the damage dealt, rounded up. Excludes attacks on multiple targets and [[special attack]]s. It is a permanent unlock.
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], it can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune'' and is a permanent unlock. There is no limit on how many permanent sigils can be active at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using it on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
The healing gained from dealing <math display="inline">x</math> damage is <math display="inline">\,\left\lceil\displaystyle\frac{x}{10}\right\rceil</math>. This healing, as a percentage of damage dealt, is: <math display="inline">\,\,\displaystyle\frac{100\left\lceil\displaystyle\frac{x}{10}\right\rceil}{x}\,\%</math>
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Upon a successful hit, your Hitpoints are restored by 10% of the damage dealt, rounded up. Excludes attacks on multiple targets and special attacks. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Upon a successful hit, your hitpoints are restored by 10% of the damage dealt, rounded up. Excludes attacks on multiple targets and special attacks. |}
