{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of specialised strikes |image1 = [[File:Sigil of specialised strikes.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of specialised strikes (attuned).png]] |release = [[25 August]] [[2021]] |update = Deadman: Reborn |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Activate, Check, Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Activate the sigil to reduce the cost of your next special attack by 10 (the attack must cost more than 10 energy). This effect lasts for 12 seconds and has a 10 second cooldown. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 26060 |id2 = 26059 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of specialised strikes detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of specialised strikes (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of Specialised Strikes''' is a tier 2 combat [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is an attunable sigil and, when activated, reduces the cost of your next [[special attack]]. It must be carried in the [[inventory]] to be used.
