In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Your melee accuracy is increased by +30 in stab, slash and crush. Additionally, upon a successful hit, you have a 30% chance for your next successful hit to deal +10 damage. There is a 10 second cooldown before this can reoccur. Does not work for special attacks. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Your melee accuracy is increased by +30 in stab, slash and crush. Additionally, upon a successful hit, you have a 30% chance for your next hit to deal +10 damage. |- |[[Deadman: Apocalypse]] |Your melee accuracy is increased by +30 in stab, slash and crush. Additionally, upon a successful hit, you have a 20% chance for your next hit to deal +5 damage. |- |[[Deadman: Reborn]] |Your melee accuracy is increased by +10 in stab, slash and crush. Additionally, upon a successful hit, you have a 20% chance for your next hit to deal +5 damage. |}
