{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of the rigorous ranger |image1 = [[File:Sigil of the rigorous ranger.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of the rigorous ranger (attuned).png]] |release = [[25 August]] [[2021]] |update = Deadman: Reborn |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Your ranged accuracy is increased by +20, and you have a 50% chance to save ammunition when using ranged weapons, except when throwing chinchompas. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 26000 |id2 = 25999 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of the rigorous ranger detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of the rigorous ranger (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of the Rigorous Ranger''' is a tier 1 combat [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is an attunable sigil that increases [[Ranged]] accuracy and gives a 50% chance to save ammunition (not including [[Chinchompa (disambiguation)|chinchompas]]).
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], the un-attuned version can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune''. Up to three attunable sigils can be attuned at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using them on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Your ranged accuracy is increased by +20, and you have a 50% chance to save ammunition when using ranged weapons, except when throwing [[Chinchompa (disambiguation)|chinchompas]]. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Your ranged accuracy is increased by +20, and you have a 50% chance of saving ammunition when using Ranged weapons, except when throwing Chinchompas. |- |[[Deadman: Apocalypse]] |Your ranged accuracy is increased by +10, and you have a 50% chance of saving ammunition when using Ranged weapons, except when throwing Chinchompas. |- |[[Deadman: Reborn]] |Your ranged accuracy is increased by +10, and you have a 50% chance of saving ammunition when using Ranged weapons, except when throwing Chinchompas. |}
