{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of the ruthless ranger |image1 = [[File:Sigil of the ruthless ranger.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of the ruthless ranger (attuned).png]] |release = [[25 August]] [[2021]] |update = Deadman: Reborn |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = Upon dealing ranged damage, you have a 15% chance to cripple the target's movement. The effect deals 15 damage (33% less damage in 3-60 worlds) over the next 6 seconds and also drains a total of 15 run energy in that time. The damage is doubled against targets with less than 10% run energy. A target can only suffer from one crippling effect at a time. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 26072 |id2 = 26071 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of the ruthless ranger detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of the ruthless ranger (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of the Ruthless Ranger''' is a tier 2 combat [[Deadman Mode]] sigil. It is the basic [[Ranging]] sigil and can be chosen for free as a starting sigil in [[Deadman: Annihilation]] or purchased for [[Deadman: Annihilation/Points|points]] thereafter. It gives a chance to cripple the target's movement when dealing ranged damage, dealing ranged damage over time and draining run energy. It is an attunable sigil.
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], the un-attuned version can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune''. Up to three attunable sigils can be attuned at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using them on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |Upon dealing ranged damage, you have a 15% chance to cripple the target's movement. The effect deals 15 damage (33% less damage in 3-60 worlds) over the next 6 seconds and also drains a total of 15 run energy in that time. The damage is doubled against targets with less than 10% run energy. A target can only suffer from one crippling effect at a time. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |Upon dealing Ranged damage, you have a 10% chance to cripple the target's movement. The effect deals 15 damage over the next 6 seconds and drains a total of 30 run energy in that time. The damage is doubled against targets with no run energy. A target can only suffer from one crippling effect at a time. |- |[[Deadman: Apocalypse]] |Upon dealing Ranged damage, you have a 10% chance to cripple the target's movement. The effect deals 5 damage over the next 6 seconds and drains a total of 30 run energy in that time. The damage is doubled against targets with no run energy. A target can only suffer from one crippling effect at a time. |- |[[Deadman: Reborn]] |Upon dealing Ranged damage, you have a 10% chance to cripple the target's movement. The effect deals 5 damage over the next 6 seconds and drains a total of 30 run energy in that time. The damage is doubled against targets with no run energy. A target can only suffer from one crippling effect at a time. You also gain an additional 50% XP in the Ranged skill. |}
==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 23 August 2023 |update = Deadman: Apocalypse - Friday 25th August |change = The sigil no longer gives a 50% XP bonus in Ranged for Deadman: Apocalypse. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
