{{Deadman seasonal}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Un-attuned |version2 = Attuned |name = Sigil of the swashbuckler |image1 = [[File:Sigil of swashbuckler.png]] |image2 = [[File:Sigil of swashbuckler (attuned).png]] |release = [[17 July]] [[2024]] |update = Deadman: Armageddon & While Guthix Sleeps Updates |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable1 = No |tradeable2 = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Attune, Inspect, Destroy |options2 = Inspect, Unattune, Destroy |destroy1 = You can sell duplicate sigils by using them on Deadman's skull. |destroy2 = You must unattune the Sigil before you can destroy it. |examine1 = All melee weapons with a base attack speed above 4 will have it reduced by 1. Cannot be used in conjunction with the Sigil of the Gunslinger or the Sigil of Arcane Swiftness. |examine2 = A sigil attuned to you with great power. |value = 1 |weight = 0.100 |id1 = 29673 |id2 = 29672 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Sigil of swashbuckler detail.png|left|150px]] |version2 = [[File:Sigil of swashbuckler (attuned) detail.png|left|150px]] }} The '''Sigil of the Swashbuckler''' is a tier 2 [[Deadman Mode]] combat sigil. It is an attunable sigil that reduces the [[attack speed]] of 5-tick or slower [[Melee]] weapons by 1. It cannot be used with the [[Sigil of the Gunslinger]] or the [[Sigil of Arcane Swiftness]].
In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], the un-attuned version can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune''. Up to three attunable sigils can be attuned at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using them on the [[deadman's skull]].
In past [[Deadman Mode]] events, the un-attuned version was dropped by most monsters (via the [[Drop table#Deadman Mode|Deadman Mode drop table]]) and was tradeable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
==Effect== {|class=wikitable !Event !Effect |- class="table-yes" |[[Deadman: Annihilation]] |All melee weapons with a base [[attack speed]] above 4 will have it reduced by 1. Cannot be used in conjunction with the [[Sigil of the Gunslinger]] or the [[Sigil of Arcane Swiftness]]. |- |[[Deadman: Armageddon]] |The attack speed of all melee weapons with a base attack speed above 4 will be reduced by 1. Cannot be used in conjunction with the sigil of gunslinger or the sigil of arcane swiftness. |}
