{{External|rs}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Sigli the Huntsman |image = [[File:Sigli the Huntsman.png|120px]] |release = [[2 November]] [[2004]] |update = The Fremennik Trials |members = Yes |race = [[Human]] |quest = [[The Fremennik Trials]] |location = [[Rellekka]] |gender = Male |options = Talk-to |examine = A Fremennik hunter. |map = {{Map|name=Sigli the Huntsman|x=2660|y=3649|plane=0|r=4|mtype=square}} |id = 3924 |leagueRegion = Fremennik }} [[File:Sigli the Huntsman chathead.png|left]] '''Sigli the Huntsman''' is a hunter in [[Rellekka]] and a member of the town council. He is found south of the longhall near the entrance. To win his vote during [[The Fremennik Trials]], you must track down and slay the [[Draugen]]. Later, he will trade the [[tracking map]] for a [[custom bowstring]] as you seek the [[exotic flower]].
If provided the raw materials and some coins, Sigli will make [[spined armour]].
==Treasure Trails== {{Anagram|Sigli|elite|[[Clue scroll (elite) - UNLEASH NIGHT MIST|UNLEASH NIGHT MIST]]}}. The answer to his challenge scroll is '''302'''. If doing an [[elite clue scroll]], he will not talk to you about it unless you have completed [[The Fremennik Trials]].
==Products== {{Uses facility list|Sigli the Huntsman}}
==Dialogue== {{hastranscript|NPC}}
==Trivia== *In the original version of [[The Fremennik Trials]] featured in the ''RuneScape 2'' beta, he appeared as the character [[Sigli (RuneScape 2 Beta)|Sigli]]. *His name is a play on the word sigil which can sometimes mean an item used to track things including mythical beasts. (e.g. the [[Draugen]]). *When discussing [[spined armour]], Sigli will refer to a [[dagannoth]] as "dagger-mouth".
{{The Fremennik Trials}} {{Rellekka}}

