==Trivia==
*In the original version of [[The Fremennik Trials]] featured in the RuneScape 2 beta, he had the name '''Sigmund''' with the examine "A viking wiseman."
*Sigmund may have two children on [[Neitiznot]], [[Thakkrad Sigmundson|Thakkrad]] and [[Bork Sigmundson]] since [[Fremennik]] culture traditionally had the child take on their father's name and the suffix "son". Therefore, Sigmundson actually means "Sigmund's son", making it possible that the two are his offspring.

