{{Infobox Scenery |name = Sign |image = [[File:Sign (Blackhole).png|250x250px]] |release = [[26 June]] [[2014]] |update = Midsummer Event |members = No |quest = None |location = [[Dwarven Mine]] |options = Read |examine = Information is displayed here. |map = {{Map|mtype=pin|mapID=6|2988,9813}} |id = 26255 }} A '''sign''' can be seen in the [[Dwarven Mine]] that shows information on the amount of visits that [[Thordur]]'s [[Blackhole]] has received on that world. To visit [[Thordur]], players must activate a [[disk of returning]] while inside the Dwarven Mine.
The sign only tracks visits to Thordur in the regular blackhole via activating the disk. Using the blackout option to enter the blacker blackhole does not count towards the visitor count. The visitor count also resets back to 0 when the server is restarted.
