{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Signed portrait |image = [[File:Signed portrait.png]] |release = [[17 May]] [[2005]] |update = Zogre Flesh Eaters |members = Yes |quest = [[Zogre Flesh Eaters]] |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Look-at, Drop |examine = A signed classic realist charcoal portrait of Sithik. |value = 1 |alchable = No |weight = 0.020 |id = 4816 }} [[File:Signed portrait detail.png|left|150px]] The '''signed portrait''' of [[Sithik Ints]] is an item used in [[Zogre Flesh Eaters]]. During the quest, the player must take a [[Sithik portrait]] to the [[Bartender (Dragon Inn)|Bartender]] to be signed, in order to charge Sithik Ints with leading [[Brentle Vahn]] to his death.
If players use the signed portrait on Sithik, Sithik will offer to bribe the player with 2 million gold, in order to buy the signed portrait. Whether the player accepts or rejects, Sithik will not buy the portrait, instead insisting that no one would believe the player anyway.
If players produce a bad Sithik portrait during their attempt, he will not sign it and the player will have to attempt to create the portrait again.
