{{Infobox Item |version1 = Closed |version2 = Open |name1 = Silklined herb sack |name2 = Open silklined herb sack |image1 = [[File:Silklined herb sack.png]] |image2 = [[File:Open silklined herb sack.png]] |release = [[25 February]] [[2026]] |update = Cow Boss is Out Today! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options1 = Fill, Open, Check, Empty, Destroy |options2 = Fill, Close, Check, Empty, Destroy |examine = A sack for storing grimy herbs. |value = 1 |alchable = No |weight = 1.000 |id1 = 33135 |id2 = 33137 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Silklined herb sack detail.png|130px|left]] |version2 = [[File:Open silklined herb sack detail.png|130px|left]] }} A '''silklined herb sack''' is an upgraded variant of the [[herb sack]], made by using a [[pristine spider silk]] on it. It will store up to 100 of each of the grimy normal [[Herb#Herb table|herbs]] instead of 30, for a total of 1,500 stored. A full herb sack is worth {{NoCoins|100*({{GEP|Grimy guam leaf}} + {{GEP|Grimy marrentill}} + {{GEP|Grimy tarromin}} + {{GEP|Grimy harralander}} + {{GEP|Grimy ranarr weed}} + {{GEP|Grimy toadflax}} + {{GEP|Grimy irit leaf}} + {{GEP|Grimy avantoe}} + {{GEP|Grimy kwuarm}}+ {{GEP|Grimy huasca}} + {{GEP|Grimy snapdragon}} + {{GEP|Grimy cadantine}} + {{GEP|Grimy lantadyme}} + {{GEP|Grimy dwarf weed}} + {{GEP|Grimy torstol}})|c}}.
Because of the greatly expanded capacity, it is a useful item for farming herbs. When open, harvested herbs will go directly into the herb sack.
==Creation== {{Recipe |members = yes |ticks = 1 |mat1 = Herb sack |mat1cost = no |mat2 = Pristine spider silk |mat2cost = no |output1 = Silklined herb sack |output1cost = no }}
