The '''Silver Cog Silver Stall''' is a [[silver stall]] run by [[Gulldamar]], a member of the Silver Cog Mining Company, part of the [[Mining Consortium]] that rules the city of [[Keldagrim]]. Gulldamar sells [[silver ore]], [[silver bar]]s, and [[unstrung symbol]]s at his [[stall]].

