{{Shops}}

{{External|rs|rsc|dw=Silver Bar}} {{Infobox Item |name = Silver bar |image = [[File:Silver bar.png]] |release = [[12 July]] [[2001]] |update = Improved prayer system and more! |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = It's a bar of silver. |value = 150 |weight = 1.814 |exchange = Yes |id = 2355 }} [[File:Silver bar detail.png|left|120px]] A '''silver bar''' is a [[bar]] of metal, refined through the [[Smithing]] skill by smelting a [[silver ore]] in a furnace, requiring 20 Smithing and granting 13.7 Smithing experience. It may also be bought (or stolen) from a [[silver merchant]], such as the one in Ardougne market, or from other players.
The primary use of a silver bar is to create [[jewellery]] with the [[Crafting]] skill. To craft silver bars into jewellery players must use a silver bar on a furnace with a proper [[mould]] in their inventory. If players wish to craft jewellery with [[gems]] inset, the cut gems must be present in the player's inventory before crafting the jewellery. One silver bar is used during the [[Creature of Fenkenstrain]] quest, and another during [[Shadow of the Storm]].
Unlike [[gold bar]]s, which cannot be made into weapons, silver bars can be made into [[silver sickle]]s. They can also be ground to [[silver dust]] in the [[Ectofuntus]] grinder for use as an ingredient in the [[guthix balance]] potion.
Currently, smelting a silver bar yields a profit of {{Coins|{{GEP|Silver bar}}-{{GEP|Silver ore}}}}.
One effective method of gathering silver bars is exchanging [[reward token]]s gained for completing [[Temple Trekking]] minigame. This method is commonly used by ironman players, as it can net upwards of 1000 silver bars per hour. ==Recipe== <tabber> Standard= {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 20 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 13.7 |members = No |ticks = 4 |facilities = Furnace |mat1 = Silver ore |output1 = Silver bar |output1subtxt = Regular furnace }} |-| Blast Furnace= {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 20 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 13.7 |members = Yes |ticks = 11 |ticksnote = Multiple bars are completed at once |facilities = Blast Furnace |mat1 = Silver ore |output1 = Silver bar |output1subtxt = Blast Furnace }} |-| Superheat= {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 20 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 13.7 |skill2 = Magic |skill2lvl = 43 |skill2boostable = Yes |skill2exp = 53 |members = No |ticks = 3 |mat1 = Silver ore |mat2 = Nature rune |mat3 = Fire rune |mat3quantity = 4 |output1 = Silver bar |output1subtxt = Superheat }} </tabber>
==Money making== {{Mmgsection|Smelting silver bars}}
