{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Silver dust |image = [[File:Silver dust.png]] |release = [[22 March]] [[2006]] |update = In Aid of the Myreque |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = It's ground up silver. |value = 200 |weight = 0.150 |exchange = Yes |id = 7650 }} [[File:Silver dust detail.png|left|130px]] '''Silver dust''' can be obtained by grinding a [[silver bar]] in the [[bone grinder]] in the [[Ectofuntus]]. Unlike most ground ingredients in [[Herblore]], silver cannot be ground down by a [[pestle and mortar]]. It is an ingredient for the [[Guthix balance]] [[potion]], used on several types of [[Vampyre]].
Silver dust is also used in [[While Guthix Sleeps]], as it must be placed on the [[Statue (Ancient Guthixian Temple)#Balance|statue of balance]] within the [[Ancient Guthixian Temple]] along with the other Guthix balance ingredients to receive a [[balance dolmen]].
==Creation== {{Recipe |members = Yes |ticks = 4 |ticksnote = Manual grinding is 4 ticks, auto-grinding is 6 ticks |facilities = Bone grinder |mat1 = Silver bar |output1 = Silver dust }}
