[[File:Silver key crimson detail.png|left|140px]]
'''Silver key crimson''' is a key and reward from the [[Shades of Mort'ton (minigame)|Shades of Mort'ton]] minigame. To obtain it, the player must kill a [[fiyr shade]] and then burn its [[Shade remains|remains]] on a pyre. The key may be used to enter the [[Shade Catacombs]] and then open the correctly coloured chest. It will open a [[Silver Chest (crimson)|silver-framed chest with a crimson lock]]. This type of key can be used to open any door within the tombs except the gold doors.

This is the most common key given when burning fiyr shades. If players are planning to kill a large number of shades, this is the type of key recommended to keep a single copy of, as it can be used to easily access the fiyr shades.

Unlike most items, this key will not despawn and cannot be taken by other players for 5 minutes when initially dropped from shade remains, similar to other keys from the Shades of Mort'ton minigame. When dropped by the player, they will despawn and become visible to others at the normal rate.

