[[File:Silver merchant chathead.png|left]]
'''Erin''', the '''Silver merchant''', runs the [[Ardougne Silver Stall.|Ardougne Silver Stall]] in [[East Ardougne]]. He plays a fairly large part in the [[Making History]] [[quest]]. The [[enchanted key]] is obtained from Erin during and after the quest; it is used in a miniquest to obtain the god [[Mjolnir]] weapons. He sells [[silver bar]]s, [[silver ore]], and [[unstrung symbol]]s on his stall, buying unstrung symbols for more coins than usual shop owners.

Players with 50+ [[Thieving]] can steal from his silver stall. Failure will result in Erin calling for a guard, disallowing you to buy anything from him for a certain amount of time.

==Family==
His great-grandfather was very likely [[Drozal]], a follower of [[Zamorak]] who lived in the [[Outpost|Ardougne Outpost]] with other Zamorakian followers.{{CiteText |text=Journal (Making History) |author=Drozal |quote=I've met a great and powerful follower of Zamorak, whom has offered me the chance to join him and others in the quest for ultimate power and desolation of others. [...] I move into the old outpost north of Ardougne at the end of the week.}} This is evidenced by Erin possessing his great grandfather's [[enchanted key]], used to find the [[Chest (Making History)|chest]] containing [[Journal (Making History)|Drozal's journal]].{{CiteNPC |npc=Silver merchant |loc=Making History |quote=The only thing I have of [my great-grandfather] is a key. It's a strange key, it changes temperature by itself as you walk around. I'm afraid I don't know what it's for, though.}}

