** {{tact|If the player has a crowbar in their inventory.}}
***{{tcond|If the player does not have the requirements to sample the drink:}}
**** {{tbox|pic=Bottle of fish bladder stout detail.png|The crate contains a bottle of [drink name], but you doubt your ability to stomach it. You need a Sailing level of [number] to do so.}}
**** {{tact|end}}
***{{tcond|If the player has not yet sampled the contents:}}
**** {{tbox|pic=Bottle of fish bladder stout detail.png|You pry open the crate and take a bottle of [drink name] to sample.}}
**** {{tact|end}}
***{{tcond|If the player has already sampled the contents:}}
**** {{tbox|pic=Bottle of fish bladder stout detail.png|The crate contains a bottle of [drink name], but you don't take it as you've already sampled it before.}}
**** {{tact|end}}
