*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|I'd like to go to Musa Point.}}
*** '''Player:''' I'd like to go to Musa Point.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Actually, I don't want to go anywhere.}}
*** '''Player:''' Actually, I don't want to go anywhere.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No thank you.}}
** '''Player:''' No thank you.
** '''Seaman Morris:''' Fair enough.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{top|cond=If the player is wearing a ring of charos(a)|(Charm) Or I could pay you nothing at all...}}
** '''Player:''' Or I could pay you nothing at all...
** '''Seaman Morris:''' Nothing at all, you say? Yes, why not. Where would you like to go?
