{{Transcript|npc}}

== Standard dialogue ==
* '''Player:''' Excuse me.
* '''Seer:''' What is it, human?
* {{topt|What are you doing up here? It doesn't seem very safe.}}
** '''Player:''' What are you doing up here? It doesn't seem very safe.
** '''Seer:''' On the contrary, it would not be safe if we were not up here!
** '''Seer:''' You see, that creature up there has a powerful divine energy about it. That energy is used to protect itself and interfere with our own divine capabilities.
** '''Player:''' Divine capabilities? You mean praying to the gods?
** '''Seer:''' Praying? Yes. To the gods? That is open to interpretation.
** '''Player:''' It is?
** '''Seer:''' I do not have the time nor desire to explain the advanced concepts of theology to you, but you should know that the Dwarves of Cam Torum take a different approach to worship than your kind.
** '''Seer:''' Anyway, the point is that without experienced seers to aid you, you may find yourself unable to utilise your prayers as you normally would.
** '''Player:''' Interesting. So we need to work together to subdue this creature?
** '''Seer:''' Indeed, just follow our lead and you'll be fine... probably.
** '''Player:''' Great! I'm happy to help!
** '''Seer:''' Good. If you have any further questions about your role here, speak to Taala.
** '''Player:''' I will, thank you.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Could I trade some tomes in?}}
** '''Player:''' Could I trade some tomes in?
** '''Seer:''' Very well.
** ''The player is prompted to input the amount of tomes they wish to trade in.''
** {{tcond|If the player inputs 0:}}
*** '''Seer:''' You can't trade in zero of an item.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player inputs more than 1:}}
*** {{tselect|Trade in 1x Tome of earth (empty) for 250x soiled pages?}}
*** {{topt|Yes.}}
**** {{tbox|pic=Soiled page detail.png|You trade 1x Tome of earth (empty) for some soiled pages.}}
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|No.}}
**** {{tact|end}}

==Overhead dialogue==
* At the Hueycoatl's body:
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Let's make this beastie move!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Block its attacks with your prayers!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Let's convince that beastie to move!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Let's go!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Nicely done!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Steady now!}}
* At the Hueycoatl's head:
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|We need to charge all of the pillars using our prayers!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Keep praying to charge the pillars!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Keep praying to bolster your strength!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Excellent! The pillars are boosting your strength!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Well done! The power of the pillars is yours!}}
* When the tail phase starts:
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|It's shielded itself! You need to break its concentration!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Watch out for its slam!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Go for the tail! It's a weakspot!}}
* When the final phase starts:
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Well done! Now, let's weaken it a little more!}}
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|We did it! Well done!}}
* When the Hueycoatl awakens:
** '''Seer:''' {{overhead|Oof!}}

