==After [[Heart of Darkness]] and before the release of [[The Final Dawn]]==
* '''Servius, Teokan of Ralos:''' Nilsal, my child. I imagine you're hoping for word on our plans for rescuing Itzla. I'm afraid nothing has been decided yet, but once that changes, I am sure you will have a part to play.
* '''Player''': I see. Thank you, Servius.
* '''Servius, Teokan of Ralos:''' Do not lose heart, my child. May the sun light your way.
* {{tact|end}}

