** '''Sharimika:''' Ahhhhhhhh - Get away from me you beast!
** '''Player:''' What's the problem....oh, I'm wearing this big scary mask! I'd better take it off before I start talking to the natives.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Sharimika:''' Waahhhhh! - It's da evil broodoo beast come ta eat my very soul!
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
** '''Sharimika:''' Ahhhhhhhh - It's a monster!
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 4}}
** '''Sharimika:''' Ahhhhhhhh!!
** {{tact|above}}

