{{Gone|Update=PvP Arena: Rewards Beta}} {{Infobox Relic |name = Profletchional |image = [[File:Profletchional.png]] |release = [[19 January]] [[2022]] |update = Leagues III - Shattered Relics Launch |removal = [[16 March]] [[2022]] |removalupdate = PvP Arena: Rewards Beta |members = Yes |league = Shattered Relics League |tier = Fragment }} '''Profletchional''' is a production-type [[Shattered_Relics_League/Fragments|fragment]] that increases experience for fletching and stringing bows in the [[Shattered Relics League]] that may be obtained from breaking an [[Unidentified fragment (production)|unidentified production fragment]].
This fragment counts towards [[The Craftsman]] and [[Last Recall (Shattered Relics)|Last Recall]] [[Shattered_Relics_League/Fragments#Set_effects|set effects]].
{| class="wikitable" style=width:500px; ! Level !! Effect |- | 1 | Fletching logs and stringing bows grant 30% more [[Fletching]] experience. |- | 2 | Fletching experience is increased by 50%. |- | 3 | Fletching experience is doubled. |}
{{Shattered Relics League}}

