==Standard dialogue==
* '''Sheryl:''' Welcome to the Cloak and Stagger! Anything I can get you?
* {{topt|I'd like to order a drink, please.}}
** '''Player:''' I'd like to order a drink, please.
** '''Sheryl:''' Of course, what would you like?
** {{tact|opens=The Cloak and Stagger}}
* {{topt|Got anything special on tap?}}
** '''Player:''' Got anything special on tap?
** '''Sheryl:''' We're always running a keg of our locally-brewed ale, Lizardkicker.
** '''Sheryl:''' I will warn you though, its an acquired taste.
** '''Player:''' What's in it?
** '''Sheryl:''' Oh, the usual... Wheat, hops, yeast...
** '''Sheryl:''' ...reptile scales...
** '''Player:''' Scales?!
** '''Sheryl:''' Don't worry about the scales.
** '''Sheryl:''' Was there anything else?
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|What is this place?}}
** '''Player:''' What is this place?
** '''Sheryl:''' This here is the Cloak and Stagger. The finest drinking establishment in the whole of Shayzien.
** '''Player:''' Isn't it the only pub in the city?
** '''Sheryl:''' Like I say, the finest in all of Shayzien!
** '''Sheryl:''' Most of our patrons are soldiers returning on leave from the frontlines. We do get a few regular folk in too though.
** '''Sheryl:''' By the way, its generally considered polite to buy a drink if you're going to stand around and chat.
** '''Sheryl:''' ...With that said, is there anything else I can help you with?
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|Have you heard any rumours here?}}
** '''Player:''' Have you heard any rumours here?
** {{tcond|If [[Client of Kourend]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' Apparently Veos is looking for some help with something. He hangs around the docks of Port Piscarilius.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[The Queen of Thieves]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' They say there's trouble in Port Piscarilius. Something about gangs uniting. Might be worth looking into.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[The Depths of Despair]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' I hear that Lord Hosidius has misplaced one of his sons. The Hosidius family might pay a lot to see him returned safely.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[Tale of the Righteous]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' Phileas Rimor has supposedly been looking for some assistance with something in Shayzien. Maybe worth investigating.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[The Forsaken Tower]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' I hear that the rulers of Lovakengj have some work available. You'll find them in the Lovakengj Assembly.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[The Ascent of Arceuus]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' Apparently there's been some commotion in the middle of Arceuus. Might be worth checking out.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[A Kingdom Divided]] has not been started:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' That protest outside Kourend Castle is starting to attract some attention. Could be worth taking a look.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If all quests above have been completed:}}
*** '''Sheryl:''' No, it hasn't been very busy lately.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Actually, I think I need to be going.}}
** '''Player:''' Actually, I think I need to be going.
** '''Sheryl:''' Safe travels!
** {{tact|end}}

