{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Player:''' Hello there.
* '''Shield master:''' Greetings adventurer.
* {{topt|What's with all the shields?}}
** '''Player:''' What's with all the shields?
** '''Shield master:''' Although archers like myself like to keep distance from our enemies, it's always good to have a bit of protection.
** '''Player:''' Very sensible! Did you make these yourself?
** '''Shield master:''' I am a bit of a craftsman, I indeed made all these shields.
** '''Player:''' How do you make them?
** '''Shield master:''' It's very simple! First you'll need to be skilled in crafting and fletching, the exact details you can find in your skill guide.
** '''Shield master:''' For every shield, you'll require some tools! A knife for fletching the wood and a hammer for crafting the shield.
** '''Shield master:''' As for resources, you'll need 2 logs, 2 pieces of tanned leather and 15 nails.
** '''Player:''' Where can I find out more information about the resources needed?
** '''Shield master:''' I have a flyer! It details all the shields and the resources needed for them.
** '''Player:''' May I have a resource flyer?
** {{tcond|If the player doesn't have a [[leather shields flyer]] in their inventory:}}
*** '''Shield master:''' Of course! The more you know, the better!
*** {{tbox|The Shield Master hands you {{Colour|#000080|'Leather Shields - Resource information flyer'}}.}}
*** '''Player:''' Thanks!
** {{tcond|If the player already has a leather shields flyer in their inventory:}}
*** '''Shield master:''' You already have a flyer, I've only so many left.
*** '''Player:''' Fair enough.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Who are you?}}
** '''Player:''' Who are you?
** '''Shield master:''' My name is William! And I'll tell you this, I'm the best crossbowman this side of White Wolf Mountain.
** '''Player:''' Who's better than you on the other side of the mountain?
** '''Shield master:''' Couldn't tell you that myself, never been there.
** '''Player:''' Oh... How did you come across that crossbow then?
** '''Shield master:''' Oh this? Some wandering merchant came by recently, told me it was the stealthiest crossbow there was.
** '''Player:''' Is it?
** '''Shield master:''' Well, he told me it was his last one too, so I figured I'd give it a try.
** '''Player:''' It was nice meeting you William.
** '''Shield master:''' I bet!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|May I have a resource flyer?}}
** '''Player:''' May I have a resource flyer?
** {{tcond|If the player doesn't have a leather shields flyer in their inventory:}}
*** '''Shield master:''' Of course! The more you know, the better!
*** {{tbox|The Shield Master hands you {{Colour|#000080|'Leather Shields - Resource information flyer'}}.}}
*** '''Player:''' Thanks!
** {{tcond|If the player already has a leather shields flyer in their inventory:}}
*** '''Shield master:''' You already have a flyer, I've only so many left.
*** '''Player:''' Fair enough.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Bye!}}
** '''Player:''' Bye!
** '''Shield master:''' Stay protected adventurer, for it's dangerous out there.
** {{tact|end}}

