* '''Player:''' I have this voucher for completing the combat Adventure Path, it says to come talk to you about claiming my Adventure Path reward.
* '''Shop keeper:''' I do, but you need to be on a members world for me to give you the reward. Maybe there is something else I can help you with.
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Yes, please!}}
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|No, I'm okay for swords right now.}}
** {{tact|above}}

==Redeeming combat adventure path rewards in members==
* '''Shop keeper:''' Hello, bold adventurer! Can I interest you in some swords?
* '''Player:''' I have this voucher for completing the combat Adventure Path, it says to come talk to you about claiming my Adventure Path reward.
* {{tcond|If the player does not have inventory space:}}
** '''Shop keeper:''' I will be able to give you your reward when you have some space for it.
** '''Shop keeper:''' Can I help you with anything else?
** {{tselect|Select an Option}}
** {{topt|Yes, please!}}
*** {{tact|above}}
** {{topt|No, I'm okay for swords right now.}}
*** {{tact|above}}
* {{tcond|If the player has at least one free inventory space:}}
** '''Shop keeper:''' Why yes, here is one of our finest swords.
** {{tact|receives=an [[adamant sword]]}}
** '''Shop keeper:''' I also sell other weapons if you are interested.
** {{tselect|Select an Option}}
** {{topt|Yes, please!}}
*** {{tact|above}}
** {{topt|No, I'm okay for swords right now.}}
*** {{tact|above}}

