==Standard dialogue==
{{Main|Transcript:Icthlarin's Little Helper#Talking to Siamun}}

==Standard dialogue after finishing [[Icthlarin's Little Helper]]==
* '''Player:''' Hello.
* '''Siamun:''' Do you need something?
* '''Player:''' No.
* '''Siamun:''' Well I have lots to do, so good day.
* {{tact|end}}

===During the Rogue Trader miniquest===
====First talk====
* '''Player:''' Hello, Siamun?
* '''Siamun:''' What?
* '''Player:''' So you are Siamun then?
* '''Siamun:''' Yes now what do you want?
* '''Player:''' Wow, are you this friendly to everyone?
* '''Siamun:''' Just you. Now what do you want?
* '''Player:''' A mutual friend of ours, Ali Morrisane, wants you to supply his stall in Al Kharid with your garments.
* '''Siamun:''' Now why would I do that?
* '''Player:''' Well for one, you'd probably sell more clothes and once the people of Al Kharid see your amazing works of tailoring, I'm sure they'd spread the word of your clothes far and wide.
* '''Siamun:''' Interesting, but I would need more materials to accomplish what you ask of me.
* '''Player:''' Well then what do you need?
* '''Siamun:''' Either get me 3 pots of dye, or 3 animal pelts of the same variety and whatever you do, don't bring me any certs.
* {{topt|What do you mean by animal pelt?}}
** '''Player:''' What do you mean by animal pelt?
** '''Siamun:''' Just get me 3 cowhides, 3 wolf or snake skins or the shearings of 3 sheep. Simpler still get me 3 pots of dye and whatever you do, don't bring me any certs.
** '''Player:''' Ok, I'll get you the materials.
** '''Siamun:''' Unless you've got the materials on you?
** {{tcond|If the player does not have the 3 dyes/hides on them:}}
*** '''Player:''' Ummm.. No.
*** '''Siamun:''' Keh! Come back when you have what I need.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has the 3 dyes/hides on them:}}
*** '''Player:''' Yup, I've got what you want with me.
*** You give the merchant the [dye/animal pelts].
*** '''Siamun:''' Thank you adventurer. I will get my goods up to that merchant thief - Ali Morrisane as quickly as possible.
*** '''Player:''' Think nothing of it. I'm looking forward to seeing what you've produced for the Al Kharid market.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Ok, I'll get you the materials.}}
** {{tact|Same as above from "Ok, I'll get you the materials."}}

====When talked to again without having delivered the items====
* '''Player:''' Hello Siamun.
* '''Siamun:''' Have you got what I asked for yet?
* '''Player:''' A hello would have been nice.
* '''Siamun:''' Look I'm not nice, now did you get what I asked for or not?
* {{tcond|If the player does not have the 3 dyes/hides on them:}}
** '''Player:''' Ummm.. No.
** '''Siamun:''' Keh! Come back when you have what I need.
** {{topt|Umm... What do you need again?}}
*** '''Player:''' Umm... What do you need again?
*** '''Siamun:''' Just get me 3 cowhides, 3 wolf or snake skins or the shearings of 3 sheep. Simpler still just get me 3 pots of dye and whatever you do, don't bring me any certs.
*** '''Player:''' Ok, I'll get you the materials.
*** '''Siamun:''' Unless you've got the materials on you?
*** '''Player:''' Ummm.. No.
*** '''Siamun:''' Keh! Come back when you have what I need.
*** {{topt|Umm... What do you need again?}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Ok.}}
**** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|Ok.}}
*** '''Player:''' Ok.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player has the 3 dyes/hides on them:}}
** '''Player:''' Yup, I've got what you want with me.
** {{tbox|You give the merchant the [dye/hides].}}
** '''Siamun:''' Thank you adventurer. I will get my goods up to that merchant thief - Ali Morrisane as quickly as possible.
** '''Player:''' Think nothing of it. I'm looking forward to seeing what you've produced for the Al Kharid market.
** {{tact|end}}

====When talked to again having delivered the items before talking to Ali Morrisane====
* '''Player:''' Hello Siamun.
* '''Siamun:''' Hello adventurer. Have you checked with Ali M whether my garments are selling or not?
* '''Player:''' Not yet, I have a few things to do first.
* '''Siamun:''' Well I would be very much obliged if you could have a talk with him sooner rather than later, I'm not all that sure of the trustworthiness of those carpet men.
* '''Player:''' Don't worry, I'll get to it.
* {{tact|end}}

====When talked to again after talking to Ali Morrisane====
* '''Player:''' Hello Siamun.
* '''Siamun:''' Hello adventurer. How are sales going?
* '''Player:''' Not too bad, Ali was well impressed by the reaction and demand they had initially but he's a little concerned about how the sales have dropped off of recent.
* '''Siamun:''' Hmmm... Maybe I could produce a different range of products.
* {{tcond|If already selling desert clothing:}}
** '''Siamun:''' I tell you what, get me 3 animal pelts of the same variety and I'll change the shipments around and whatever you do, don't bring me any certs.
** {{topt|What do you mean by animal pelt?}}
*** {{tact|above}}
** {{topt|Ok, I'll get you the materials.}}
*** {{tact|above}}
* {{tcond|If already selling menaphite robes:}}
** '''Siamun:''' I'll tell you what, get me 3 pots of dye and I'll change the type of garments I'm sending to Ali and whatever you do, don't bring me any certs.
** '''Player:''' Ok, I'll get you the materials.
** {{tact|end}}

==Using a potion on him==
* '''Siamun:''' What are you doing?
* '''Player:''' I thought this acne potion might help ease your itching.
* '''Siamun:''' Get away from me! I don't want your strange potions!
* '''Player:''' Sorry.
* {{tact|end}}

