==Before [[The Fremennik Trials|the Fremennik Trials]]==
====Without a [[Spined armour#Making spined armour|spined dagannoth hide]]====
* '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' I do not speak to outerlanders. If you have anything of import to say, go and speak to the Chieftain.
* {{tact|end}}

====With a spined dagannoth hide====
* {{tselect|What would you like to ask about?}}
* {{topt|Dagannoth Spined Armour}}
** '''Player:''' Hello there. I have some spined dagannoth hides, and believe you might be able to make an armour of them for me...?
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' My apologies outerlander, but we are forbidden by decree to communicate with those not of our tribe, and this includes making armour for you.
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' I suggest you speak to Brundt, our chieftain. He resides in the longhall and speaks for us all.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|The Fremennik Trials}}
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' I do not speak to outerlanders. If you have anything of import to say, go and speak to the Chieftain.
** {{tact|end}}

==After [[The Fremennik Trials|the Fremennik Trials]]==
* '''Player:''' Hello again Sigli.
* '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' Hello again to you [Fremennik name]. How goes the hunt?
* '''Player:''' The hunt? I've already done your task! That's why I'm a Fremennik now!
* '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' You think so do you? The Draugen is always out there, just as I and my hunters are always on its trail to keep it at bay.
* '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' The hunt will never end until I do.
* {{tact|end}}

==With Dagannoth hides in inventory==
* '''Player:''' Hello there. I have some spined dagannoth hides, and believe you might be able to make an armour of them for me...?
* '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' That is fine, [Fremennik name]. What type of armour were you looking for?
* {{topt|A fine helm}}
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' It will cost you 5,000 coins to make that for you. Is that acceptable?
** {{topt|YES}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has the required materials:}}
**** {{tmissing}}
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have the required materials:}}
**** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' Sorry, [Fremennik name]. I will need 1 piece of dark dagger-mouth hide, 1 circular light dagger-mouth hide and 5,000 coins to make you a hunter's helmet.
**** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' When you have them, I will still be here.
**** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|NO}}
*** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' That is fine, [Fremennik name]. What type of armour were you looking for?
*** {{topt|A fine helm}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Sturdy bodyarmour}}
**** {{tact|below}}
*** {{topt|Powerful leg armour}}
**** {{tact|below}}
* {{topt|Sturdy bodyarmour}}
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' It will cost you 10,000 coins to make that for you. Is that acceptable?
** {{topt|YES}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has the required materials:}}
**** {{tmissing}}
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have the required materials:}}
**** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' I'm sorry, but I need 3 pieces of dark dagger-mouth hide, 1 flattened hide and 10,000 coins to make you some hunter's body armour.
**** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' I will still be here when you have obtained it.
**** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|NO}}
*** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' That is fine, [Fremennik name]. What type of armour were you looking for?
*** {{topt|A fine helm}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Sturdy bodyarmour}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Powerful leg armour}}
**** {{tact|below}}
* {{topt|Powerful leg armour}}
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' It will cost you 7,500 coins to make that for you. Is that acceptable?
** {{topt|YES}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has the required materials:}}
**** {{tact|receives=[[spined chaps]]}}
**** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' That should do for any hunter! Did you want another set of hunters legs?
**** {{tselect|Select an option}}
**** {{topt|YES}}
***** {{tact|above}}
**** {{topt|NO}}
***** {{tact|below}}
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have the required materials:}}
**** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' My apologies but I will need 2 pieces of dark dagger-mouth hide, 1 stretched hide and 7,500 coins to make you some leg armour...
**** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|NO}}
*** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' That is fine, [Fremennik name]. What type of armour were you looking for?
*** {{topt|A fine helm}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Sturdy bodyarmour}}
**** {{tact|above}}
*** {{topt|Powerful leg armour}}
**** {{tact|below}}
* {{topt|Nothing}}
** '''Player:''' Actually, I don't want anything
** '''Sigli the Huntsman:''' AS{{sic}} you wish.
** {{tact|end}}

