==Standard dialogue==
* '''Silk trader:''' Do you want to buy any fine silks?
* {{topt|How much are they?}}
** '''Player:''' How much are they?
** '''Silk trader:''' 3 gp.
** {{topt|No. That's too much for me.}}
*** '''Player:''' No. That's too much for me.
*** '''Silk trader:''' 2 gp and that's as low as I'll go.
*** '''Silk trader:''' I'm not selling it for any less. You'll probably go and sell it in Varrock for a profit, anyway.
*** {{topt|2 gp sounds good.}}
**** '''Player:''' 2 gp sounds good.
**** {{tcond|If the player has enough money:}}
***** {{tbox|pic=silk_detail.png|You buy some silk for 2 gp.}}
***** {{tact|receives=Silk}}
***** {{tact|end}}
**** {{tcond|If the player does not have enough money:}}
***** '''Player:''' Oh dear. I don't have enough money.
***** '''Silk trader:''' Well, come back when you do have some money!
***** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|No, really. I don't want it.}}
**** '''Player:''' No, really. I don't want it.
**** '''Silk trader:''' Okay, but that's the best price you're going to get.
**** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Okay, that sounds good.}}
*** '''Player:''' Okay, that sounds good.
*** {{tcond|If the player has enough money:}}
**** {{tbox|pic=silk_detail.png|You buy some silk for 3 gp.}}
**** {{tact|receives=Silk}}
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{tcond|If the player does not have enough money:}}
**** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|No. Silk doesn't suit me.}}
** '''Player:''' No. Silk doesn't suit me.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has started [[Family Crest]], but not met [[Avan]]:|I'm in search of a man named Avan Fitzharmon.}}
** '''Player:''' I'm in search of a man named Avan Fitzharmon.
** '''Silk trader:''' Can't say as I've seen him... I'm sure if he's been to Al Kharid recently someone around here will have though.
** {{tact|end}}

