==After The Giant Dwarf and if the player didn't join their company==
* {{trandom}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' I'm too important to talk to the likes of you, leave.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' My secretary will deal with any inquiries you have about the Silver Cog.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' My secretary is sitting just over there, thank you.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 4}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' I'm busy, please leave.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 5}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' Today is not a good day, can you come back tomorrow?
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 6}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' If you're looking for the market, it's downstairs.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 7}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' Do you mind? You're blocking my view.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 8}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' How did you get in here? I don't have time to talk to you!
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 9}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' I can't help you, go and see my secretary.
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 10}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' Talk to my secretary, I don't have time to deal with you.
** {{tact|continues}}
* '''Player:''' But...
* {{trandom}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' I said go!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Silver Cog Director:''' I told you to leave, human!
** {{tact|end}}

{{Transcript|NPC}}

==Standard dialogue==
* {{trandom}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' What can I do for you, human?
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' Can I help you with anything?
* {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' Was there anything you wanted?
* {{topt|Dialogue 4}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' What did you need of the White Chisel?
* {{topt|Dialogue 5}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' Is there anything you need assistance with?
* {{topt|Dialogue 6}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' And what can I do for you?
** {{tact|continues}}
* {{tselect|Select an option}}
* {{topt|Who are you?}}
** '''Player:''' Who are you?
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' I am the head secretary of the White Chisel.
** '''Player:''' The what?
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' The Silver Cog! A shining example of how a mining company should be run to join the Consortium.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|Where am I?}}
** '''Player:''' Where am I?
** {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
*** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' These are the offices of the Silver Cog.
*** {{tact|continues}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
*** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' This is the official residence of the Silver Cog.
*** {{tact|continues}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
*** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' Why, you are in the headquarters of the Silver Cog.
*** {{tact|continues}}
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' We share this floor of the palace with the other companies of the Consortium. And trade with them on the Trade Octagon.
** '''Player:''' The Trade Octagon?
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' See those traders out there, just out the door? They're all standing in the Trade Octagon. There's an awful lot of trade going on in the palace, you know.
** '''Player:''' Anything else of interest in the palace?
** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' You will have to find that out on your own, I'm afraid. I do have more work to do.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|Is there anything I can help you with?}}
** {{tact|The player is offered a task; see [[Transcript:The Giant Dwarf#Talking_to_a_company_secretary]]}}
* {{topt|I have to go!}}
** {{trandom}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
*** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' Goodbye, human.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
*** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' See you later.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
*** '''Silver Cog Secretary:''' Okay.
*** {{tact|end}}

